<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">MAS - Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 MASEUTA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha kaidi cha Maseuta</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maseuta</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mas</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHITABU CHA KAIDI CHA MASEUTA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MASEUTA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu vya 1 Maseuta na 2 Maseuta vya mwe nkongo vyendaga chitabu chimwenga chikulu. Nkanana ya nkongo vyasankagwa na kutenda vitabu vidi mwe lavyo dya Bibiliya dya Seputuaginti, lavyo idyo nidyo dya chikale vitendese dya Lagano dya Kale kwa longa dya Chigiliki. Ichindedi havikumanyika uyo awandike ivitabu vino vya 1 Maseuta na 2 Maseuta, hegu kuviwanda savino viwandigwe haluseka. Mta kuwandika ywe vitabu vya Masuta ajesezaga baluwa siku za chikale mo kuwandika (kaula 1 Masuta 11:41 na 14:19, na 14:29 uge miligano ikulavyanya ichindedi chino). Iviya havikumanyika vitabu vino vyawandikagwa umo ini hegu kuwandwa savino viwandigwe. Ni pwilili kugamba vyabindilizagwa umo seuta Yekoniya eze alekelwe kulawa ko usamizo Babeli mo mhilimo wa 561 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa, kulawana ne chindedi kugamba ulailo uwo utambaliswa mwe chitabu cha kaidi cha Maseuta sula ya 25:27. Wasomile walozize wa mbuli za Bibiliya wazumila kugamba hantu hakulu mwe ivitabu vino hawandikagwa mihilimo ilozize chipindi icho hechinati. Vitabu vya 1 Masuta na 2 Maseuta vyatambalisa mbuli za chila seuta ywa Izulaeli na Yuda kulawa mo useta we chipindi cha kulongoza kwakwe seuta Sulemani, umo awantu we izisi zino mbili wachei walungana. Vitabu vya 1 Maseuta na 2 Maseuta vyatambalisa useuta wa Izulaeli ilungane ivyo usopane na kutenda seuta mbili zitimile lujendo lwesimane, kubula hadya seuta zino zihudigwe ni wantu we izisi ntuhu na awantu wakwe kusamizwa na kwigalwa ko ujeni. Mta kuwandika azuzia umbuya wa chila seuta na Chohile vileke amanye uneva kamtimila Chohile kwa chindedi hegu bule. Maseuta wasiku wadamanyaga “Mbuli zedi kulongozi kwa ZUMBE” (2 Maseuta 18:3). Watuhu wadamanayaga “Mbuli zihiye kulongozi kwa ZUMBE” (2 Maseuta 21:2). Mta kuwandika atamwilisa mbuli za ulongozi wa maseuta wadamanye mbuli zedi kulongozi kwa ZUMBE na kulagisa kugamba kuchumilwa kwa chila wantu mwe izisi kulawana na ukanuni wa seuta kwa Chohile. Mwe chita cha 2 Maseuta 17:7, chasoma kugamba Izulaeli watahagwa na kwigalwa kwe ujeni enga watumwa kwa mbuli zino zikutimila, “Mbuli izo zilaila kwaviya wana wa Izulaeli wakolaga masa kwa Zumbe”. Naho kwaviya, “Wavikilaga milungu mituhu.”</para>
  <para style="io">Yemndani, 1. Mwe chitabu cha 1 Masetu sula ya 1-11 zatamwila ivyo Sulemani mwana ywa Daudi atendaga seuta na mbuli zo ulongozi wakwe mwa useuta wa Izulaeli ilungane. 2. Mwe sula ya 12-16 chasoma mwe mbuli za kusopa ko useuta wa Izulaeli na Yuda, na iviya maseuta wasiku we izisi zino mbili. 3. Sula za 17-19 zatamwila mbuli za undima wa muwoni Eliya vikutendesa kuhigana kwakwe na seuta na Ahabu ywa Izulaeli. 4. Sula za 20-22 zatamwila mbuli za udumo zo ulongozi wa seuta Ahabu mwa Izulaeli, iviya mbuli za maseuta watuhu walongoze yeye eze aheze, hamwenga na mbuli za maseuta wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="io">Yemndani mwe chitabu cha 2 Maseuta. 1. Sula 1-8:15 zatamwila mbuli zilaile zo udumo mo undima wa muwoni Eliya, iviya na undima wa muwoni Elisha endaga mwanampina na mta kulisi undima wakwe. 2. Mwe sula za 8:16-17 chasoma mbuli za maseuta watuhu wa Izulaeli na Yuda, hamwenga na mbuli za wana wa Izulaeli wegalwe ko usamizo (ko utumwa). 3. Sula za 18-20 zatamwila mbuli za ulongozi wa Hezekiya seuta ywa Yuda, na ivyo amwetegeleze na kumtiila Zumbe. 4. Sula za 21-25 zitambalisa mbuli za wikazi wa maseuta wo udumo walongoze isi ya Yuda, na ivyo isi ya Yuda yebingigwe na kutahwa na kwigalwa Babeli ko utumwa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Muoni Eliya na seuta Ahaziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Ahabu seuta ywa Izulaeli eze abanike, wantu wa Moabu niyo wahitukila wasekulongozwa ni wantu wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="2KI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Seuta Ahaziya umo endaga uko Samaliya kalagala kulawa kulanga kwe golofa vyaleka alumila vihiye. Elo niyo asigila walosi, awagamba, “Hitani kwa Baali Zebubu, mnungu ywo umzi wa Ekuloni, mkamuze hegu unyonje uno nanihone.” <verse eid="2KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Mna mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba muwoni Eliya mwikazi ywa umzi wa Tishibe, “Halawe wite ukadugane na awalosi awo uwauze, ‘Kwa mbwani mwaita kwa Baali Zebubu mnungu ywa Ekuloni? Mwe isi ya Izulaeli hamna Chohile?’ <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Mgambileni seuta kugamba, Zumbe Chohile kagamba vino, ‘Kwa ukanuni, hosele molusazi ukweile mlanga mwakwe, mna chindedi nobanike.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:4">Eliya niyo adamanya saviya Zumbe alongile. <verse eid="2KI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Wadya awalosi weze wauye kwa seuta, seuta niyo awauza, “Ni mbwani msunguza kuuya?”<verse eid="2KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Awalosi niyo wamhitula, “Chidugana na mntu kachigamba chuye chikugambile kugamba Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, ‘Ni mbwani watuma walosi kwa Baali Zebubu, mnungu ywa Ekuloni? Togola, mweisi ya Izulaeli hamna Chohile? Umo mlanga mo lusazi ukweile hosele mlanga mwakwe. Ko ukanuni nobanike.’”<verse eid="2KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Seuta niyo awauza, “Mntu mdugane naye niyo awagambilani izimbuli izo evivihi?”<verse eid="2KI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Niyo wamhitula, “Nendile kavala suche za mazoya na mwe chigudi nendile kanyinya msipi wa mkota.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:8">Niyo seuta agamba, “Uyo ni Eliya ywa Tishibe!.”<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Aho, seuta niyo asigila sekulu yumwenga ywa awankondo wakwe na wantu milongo mishano wamwigaile Eliya. Sekulu uyo niyo aita ambwila Eliya kekala kulanga kwe lugulu, niyo amgamba, “Weye mntu ywa Chohile, seuta agamba sela.”<verse eid="2KI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Eliya niyo amhitula yudya sekulu, “Kwaviya miye ni mntu ywa Chohile, moto nausele kulawa kwembimbu ukutikimye weye hamwenga na wantu wose unanawo!” Niyo moto wasela kulawa kwembingu niyo wambalanga uyo sekulu na awantu milongo mishano nendile we wose.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Seuta niyo atuma sekulu mtuhu na wantu watuhu milongo mishano wambase Eliya. Yudya sekulu niyo amgamba Eliya, “Weye mntu ywa Chohile seuta agamba sunguza sela!”<verse eid="2KI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Eliya niyo amhitula, “Kwaviya miye ni mntu ywa Chohile, moto nausele kulawa kwembingu ukutikimye weye hamwenga na wantu mwi wose!” Moto wa Chohile kulawa kwembingu niyo wasela niyo wambalanga hamwenga na awantu wakwe milongo mishano.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Seuta niyo asigila sekulu mtuhu nkanana ya katatu hamwenga na wantu milongo mishano. Sekulu uyo ywa katatu niyo akwela kulanga ko lugulu, afika madi kulongozi kwa Eliya na kweila akagamba, “Weye mntu ywa Chohile, nakweila uchilekeile ujima wetu miye hamwenga na awandima wako wano milongo mishano usekuchikoma. <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Vilongozi waidi walongole na awantu wawo, watikimya ni moto useile kulawa kwembingu, mna haluse nakweila fila mbazi uwikazi wangu.”<verse eid="2KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Ahadya, mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe niyo amgamba Eliya, “Sela hamwenga naye, naho usekumogoha.” Eliya niyo enuka asela hamwenga naye kubula kwa seuta. <verse eid="2KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Eliya niyo amgamba seuta, “Zumbe agamba vino, ‘Kwaviya kutuma walosi waite wakauze ulangilizi kwa Baali Zebubu mnungu ywa Ekuloni saviya mweisi ya Izulaeli hamna Chohile ukudaha kumuza ulangilizi, ivyo mo ulusazi ukweile hosele mlanga mwakwe. Chindedi nobanike!’”<verse eid="2KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Elo, Ahaziya niyo abanika saviya Zumbe Chohile amgambile muwoni ywakwe Eliya. Kwaviya Ahaziya nendile hana mwana ywa chilume, Yolamu niyo atenda seuta hantu hakwe, mo mhilimo wa kaidi wo ulongozi wa Yeholamu mwana ywa Yehoshefati seuta ywa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Mbuli ntuhu adamanye Ahaziya zose ziwandikwa mwe ichitabu cha Mbuli za Mihilimo ya Maseuta wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Eliya enulwa aita kwembingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Elo, chipindi cha Zumbe Chohile chize chibule cha kumguha Eliya kumwigala kwembingu mwe luzimu, Eliya na Elisha nendile wemwe sila walawa Giligali. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Wakatenda wemwe sila, Eliya niyo amgamba Elisha, “Hampu ikala hano. Zumbe Chohile kanisigila nite Beteli.” Mna Elisha niyo amgamba, “Nelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe mta ujima naho nelisa kwa zina dyako, sahwase. Ivyo niyo waitanya kubula Beteli.”<verse eid="2KI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Buna dya waoni wa Beteli niyo wambasa Elisha wamuza, “Togola kuvimanya kugamba dyelo Zumbe namguhe sekulu ywako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:3">Elisha niyo ahitula, “Heye sivimanya imbuli iyo ilekeni.”<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Eliya niyo amgamba Elisha, “Hampu ikala hano, Zumbe kanisigila nite Yeliko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:4">Mna Elisha niyo alemela amgamba, “Nelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe mta ujima naho nelisa kwa zina dyako, sahwase.” Ivyo niyo waitanya Yeliko.<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Bunga dya waoni wa Yeliko niyo wambasa Elisha wamuza, “Togola kuvimanya kugamba dyelo Zumbe namuse sekulu ywako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">Elisha niyo ahitula, “Heye sivimanya imbuli iyo ilekeni.”<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Eliya niyo amgamba Elisha, “Hampu ikala hano, Zumbe kanigamba nite komto wa Yolodani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Mna Elisha niyo amgamba, “Nelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe mta ujima naho nelisa kwa zina dyako, sahwase.” Elo niyo waitanya. <verse eid="2KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Waoni milongo mishano niyo wawatimila kubula ko mto wa Yolodani. Eliya na Elisha niyo wachimala hajihi no umto wa Yolodani, waoni awo nawachimala hale hadodo. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Eliya niyo ahambula idijuba dyakwe adikunja atowa mwa amazi yapangana haidi niyo wadelukila ntendele ya kaidi hantu hainyaile. <verse eid="2KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Weze wadeluke Eliya niyo amgamba Elisha, “Nigambila imbuli ukunga hutendele sinati kuswa kulongozi kwako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:9">Elisha niyo amgamba, Nakulombeza uninke udahi nkanana mbili chani nilisi viya ukudamanya.”<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Eliya niyo amhitula, “Lombezo dyako dibuka udala. Mna hegu unaniwona hauswa hako navitende saivyo ukunga. Mna hegu hunaniwone, havitende saivyo ukunga.”<verse eid="2KI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Umo wakajenda na kutamwila, chipumpa niyo kwalaila lingisha dya moto ukubuluzwa ni falasi niyo wawasenta. Eliya niyo enulwa kwe mbingu mwe luzimu. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Elisha eze awone lailo idyo, niyo aila, “Ho tate, ho tate! Mkankalu ywa Izulaeli ahalawa, Elo, Elisha hamuwone naho Eliya. Elisha niyo azitoza izisuche zakwe niyo azitatula malepe maidi. <verse eid="2KI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Akaheza niyo adondola idijuba dya Eliya dilagale, auya na kuchimala mo lujevu lo mto wa Yolodani.” <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Niyo atowa amazi ne isuche ya Eliya akagamba, “Ekuhi Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Eliya?” Eze ayatowe amazi niyo yapangana ntendele mbili, adeluka abula ntendele ya kaidi. <verse eid="2KI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Diya idibunga dya awaoni kulawa Yeliko weze wamwone, niyo wagamba, “Muye wa Eliya wimndani mwa Elisha.” Ivyo, niyo waita wakumsingila wenama kulongozi kwakwe kubula hasi. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Wamgamba, “Suwe wandima wako china wakankalu milongo mishano, hampu waleke waite wakamlonde sekulu ywako. Hegu Muye wa Zumbe Chohile umwinula na kumdula kulanga kwe lugulu lusiku hegu kolongo.” Elisha niyo awahitula, “Bule msekuwasigila.” <verse eid="2KI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Mna awakankalu awo niyo walahiliza kubula awona chinanka, niyo awagamba, “Wasigileni.” Ivyo, niyo wasigila wantu milongo mishano waita wakumlonda chila hantu kwa mazuwa matatu mna hawamwone. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Wakaheza niyo wauya kwa Elisha nendile akekala uko Yeliko. Elisha niyo awauza, “Togolani siwagambileni msekwita?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpituko za Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Nyumani wantu wa Yeliko wambasa Elisha, wamgamba, “Sekulu, saviya ukuwona umzi uno ni mtana, mna mazi chinanayo yaiha naho yahosa usoka ubanike.” <verse eid="2KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Elisha niyo awagamba, “Jelani munyu mwe bakuli mpya mnigaile.” Awo niyo wamwigaila. <verse eid="2KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Elisha niyo aita kwe soko ya amazi, adula udya umunyu mndani mwa amazi, agamba, “Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, mazi yano siyatenda yawagile, kukongela haluse hayahose file hegu kubalanga usoka.” <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Mazi ayo yawagila kubula vino dyelo, saviya alongile Elisha. <verse eid="2KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Elisha kakulawa Yeliko, aita Beteli. Umo achei mwesila, wabwanga wasiku walawa komzi wakonga kumzoma wamgamba, “Uyoo ana luhala, ana luhala komtwi!” <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Elisha niyo ahituka awasinya na kuwaligita kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile. Makala maidi mavyele yakwitangwa madubu niyo yalawa kumbago, yalabatula wabwanga milongo mine na waidi mgati mwawo. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Elo, Elisha niyo ajendeleza ne intambo yakwe kubula kolugulu lwa Kalimeli, eze alawe uko niyo auya komzi wa Samaliya.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Nkondo ya Waizulzeli na Wamoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Mo mhilimo wa mlongo umwenga na mnane wo useuta wa seuta Yehoshafati ywa Yuda, Yolamu mwanawe ywa Ahabu niyo akonga kulongoza mwe isi ya Izulaeli, kalongoza kukongela Samaliya kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mlongo umwenga na midi. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Yolamu niyo adamanya yehiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, mna havyendaga saviya vya ise na nine, kwaviya nakatula umnala wa Baali adamanyaga ise. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Mna Yolamu halekile kukola masa saviya seuta Yeloboamu mwanawe dwa Nibeti amlongoile, uyo akolaga masa niyo awahosa Waizulaeli wakola masa.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Mesha seuta ywa Moabu, nendile ni mfugi ywa ngoto, chila mhilimo nendile akaliha kodi kwa seuta ywa Izulaeli ngoto laki imwenga na mazoya yakantigwe mwe ngoto laki imwenga. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Ahabu eze abanike, seuta ywa Moabu niyo amhituka seuta ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Elo, seuta Yolamu niyo akulawa komzi wa Samaliya awachisanya awagomba nkondo wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Niyo atuma ulosi kwa seuta Yehoshefati ywa Yuda, amgamba “Seuta ywa Moabu kanihituka, Togola wadaha kunambiza chitowane naye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Yohoshefati niyo amhitula “Heye miye na weye ni chintu chimwenga, awantu wangu ni saviya awako, naho falasi zangu ni saviya zako.” <verse eid="2KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Niyo amuza, “Nachiwebunge chikalaila ntendele ihi?” Yolamu niyo amhitula, “Nachiwebunge chikalaila kwedijangwa dya Edomu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Elo, seuta ywa Izulaeli niyo aita hamwenga na seuta ywa Yuda na seuta ywa Edomu. Wajenda lujendo lwa mazuwa mtandatu, niyo wasilwa ni mazi. Nendile hahana mazi mwa awagomba nkondo hegu uludimo lwawo. <verse eid="2KI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Aho, seuta ywa Izulaeli niyo agamba “Nkondo yetu! Zumbe kachilunja suwe maseuta watatu chani achijele mwe imikono ya Wamoabu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Mna seuta Yehoshefati niyo auza, “Hano hahana muwoni ywa Zumbe Chohile chikudaha kumuza ulangilizi wa Zumbe Chohile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Mndima yumwenga ywa seuta Yolamu ywa Izulaeli niyo ahitula, “Hano eyaho Elisha mwanawe dya Shafati. Uyo nendile ni mndima ywa Eliya.”<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Yehoshefati agamba uyo ni mndima ywa Chohile chindedi. Maseuta wose watatu niyo wambasa Elisha.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Elisha niyo amuza seuta ywa Izulaeli, Waunga chibwani kwangu? Wabase awaoni wabasagwa ni iso na nyokwe. Mna seuta ywa Izulaeli niyo amhitula, “Bule! Zumbe Chohile nuyo achiduganye chose watatu chani achijele mwe imikono ya Wamoabu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Elisha niyo amgamba “Nelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile, hegu nendile suyo mbuyayo Yehoshefati seuta ywa Yuda hutunya, hegu sivyo sakutolotoze hata hadodo. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Mna haluse nigaila mtowa limba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:15">Eze atowe idilimba niyo nguvu za Zumbe Chohile zamwingila Elisha, <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />agamba, “Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, ‘Fukani mabome yameme mwe idikolongo dyose. <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Hata hegu hamuwone nkung'unto hegu fula, kolongo idyo nadimeme mazi, namywe nyuwe no uludimo lwenyu.’” <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />“Mna ino siyo mbuli ndala kwa Zumbe Chohile, nawenkeni uhuda mwa Wamoabu. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Namhude chila mzi uzengelwe ngome na chila mzi mtana, naho chila mti wedi ukanteni, soko za mazi zisiteni, chila hantu hedi habalangwe kwa kumemezwa mayuwe.”<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Mtondo wakwe chipindi cha kuvika, wakaule mazi yajuluzika kulawa ntendele ya Edomu yamema chila hantu mwe idikolongo.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Wamoabu niyo weva kugamba maseuta awo watatu weza kuwebunga, wantu wose wakudaha kujeseza viziha kukongela wabwanga kubula wadalahale niyo wachimala ko mhaka wemalanya kwa nkondo. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Weze wenuke mtondo wakwe zuwa nendile dikamweka mlanga mwa amazi, Wamoabu wendile ntendele ya kaidi weze wakaule amazi yenkundu saviya sakame. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Niyo wagamba “Ino ni sakame! Unatankani maseuta awo watatu watowana wowo wenye niyo wakomana! Chiteni chikatahe ivintu wasize!”<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Mna weze wabule kwe nkambi ya Izulaeli, wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wawebunga, Wamoabu niyo wasumka. Wantu wa Izulaeli wawatimila mnyuma kuno wakawakoma kubula Moabu. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Watula imizi yawo. Chila hantu wajinkile he nkonde yedi, chila mntu kaiduila yuwe niyo inkonde yose yamema mayuwe, iviya wasita izisoko zose za amazi niyo wakanta imiti yose iyedi, vibule gati niyo wasigaila umzi umkulu wa Kilihelesi uwodu, mna wadula nkumbayuwe niyo wautandama na kuutaha.<verse eid="2KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Mna seuta ywa Moabu eze awone nkondo yamwegamila niyo aguha wantu wakwe magana mtandatu wakugomba nkondo kwa kuchela mabamba, akafanyanya ajise wankondo wakwe hagati ha seuta ywa Edomu, mna niyo adunduga. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Niyo amguha mwelekwa ywakwe ywa nkongo, uyo nakongigwa atende seuta hantu hakwe, niyo amlavya jeleko dya kubalangwa mlanga mwe ichiwambaza cho mzi. Waizulaeli weze wawone ivyo, niyo wemukwa ni maya. Wauleka umzi wauya kwe isi yawo.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Elisha amwambiza mchiwa abanikilwe ni mgosiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Elo mvyele yumwenga mgati mwa wakaza wanampina wa waoni nakambasa Elisha, niyo amgamba, “Mndima ywako mgosi wangu kabanika, wemwenye kuvimanya kugamba mndima ywako nendile akamvikila Chohile, mna nendile ana mdeni ywakwe akumtigiza mapesa keza awaguhe wanangu waidi awatende wandima wakwe.”<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Elisha niyo amuza, “Hutendele mbwani? Nigambila icho unanacho kunyumba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:2">Mvyele uyo niyo amgamba, “Miye mndima ywako kunyumba sina chintu mna nna kasupa ka mavuta.”<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Elisha niyo amgamba “Hita kwa awantu wihaguhi nawo wakwinke madumu heyena chintu vitende yalozize ivyo nopate. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Ukajika wite weye na wanawo mkevugaile kunyumba, mkonge kuyamemeza mavuta. Chila dumu mkumemeza dikeni hampezo.”<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Niyo aita akwevugaila kunyumba na wanawe, wakonga kujuluza mavuta mwa amabiga avyo. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Amadumu yose yeze yameme, niyo amgamba mwana uyumwenga, “Nigaila chiya chituhu.” Mwanawe niyo amhitula, “Hahana dumu tuhu!” Mavuta niyo yaleka kujuluzika. <verse eid="2KI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Niyo auya kwa yudya mntu ywa Chohile niyo amgambila imbuli iyo. Elisha niyo amgamba, “Hita ukatage amavuta ayo ulihe amadeni yako, ukajika weye na wanawo namwikale mkajeseza ayo nayasigaile.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha na mvyele mgoli kulawa Shunami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Zuwa dimwenga Elisha nendile kaita Shunami, kwendaga na mvyele yumwenga mgoli akwikala uko. Mvyele uyo niyo amgoneka Elisha akadye nkande kwakwe, kukongela idizuwa idyo niyo Elisha atenda mazwela ya kudya nkande kwakwe chila akajinkila uko. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Mvyele uyo niyo amgamba mgosiwe, “Kokanuni mntu yuno akwiza hano hetu chila nkanana kakukizwa ni Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Chimzengela chumba kwe igolofa chimwikiye lusazi na meza na fumbi na ta, chani chila akeza kuchitalamkila afikile umo.”<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Zuwa dimwenga Elisha niyo atalamka uko, niyo akwela kwe ichumba icho chani akagone. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Niyo amgamba umndima ywakwe Gehazi, “Mwitange uyo mvyele Mshunami.” Eze etangwe niyo eza achimala kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Elisha niyo amgamba Gehazi “Mgambe, chiwona ivyo uchidamanyize, haluse aunga chimdamanyize mbuli yani? Chimlombezeze ulosi kwa seuta, hegu kwa chilongozi ywa bunga dya wagomba nkondo?” Mvyele uyo niyo ahitula, “Hano hwikala nekala na wantu wangu mwenye.”<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Elisha niyo agamba, “Haluse chimtendele mbwani?” Gehazi ahitula “Kokanuni hana mwana, naho mgosiwe kadalahala.” <verse eid="2KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Elisha niyo amgamba Gehazi “Mwitange” Gehazi niyo amwitanga. Mvyele uyo niyo eza achimala holwivi. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Elisha amgamba, “Mhilimo ukwiza chipindi sa chino notende na mwana mwe mikono yako.” Mvyele uyo ahitula, “Bule sekulu ywangu! Weye wi mntu ywa Chohile usekunidanta miye mndima ywako!” <verse eid="2KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Mna uyo mvyele atendaga msoka na kwefungula mwana chipindi sa icho mhilimo utimile, saviya agambilwe ni Elisha. <verse eid="2KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Mwana uyo niyo akula, zuwa dimwenga ambasaga ise endile akavuna hamwenga na awavuni wakwe. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Niyo amgamba ise, “Hoi mtwi wangu!” “Mtwi wangu waniluma.” Ise niyo amgamba mndima ywakwe yumwenga, “Mwigale kwa nine.” <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Eze egalwe kwa nine, niyo ekala mlanga mwe iviga vya nine kubula nomsi, niyo abanika. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Nine niyo amwigala na kumgoneza kolusazi lwa umntu ywa Chohile, avugala ulwivi na kuhalawa. <verse eid="2KI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Kamwitanga mgosiwe amgamba, “Ninka mndima yumwenga na mpunda imwenga, chani nisunguze kumbasa yudya mntu ywa Chohile, haheza nanuye.” <verse eid="2KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Mgosiwe amuza, “Ni mbwani waunga umwone dyelo? Dyelo ni zuwa dya ngasu ya kutontomoka mnenge naho ni zuwa dya kuhumula.” Mvyele uyo ahitula, “Usa nkama.” <verse eid="2KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Katandika impunda na kumgamba mdima ywakwe, “Haluse sunguza nyaguliza, kubula aho nahugambe hunguza.” <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Elo, niyo ahalawa abula kolugulu lwa Kalimeli uko endile mntu ywa Chohile. Mntu ywa Chohile eze amwone eza, niyo amgamba mndima ywakwe Gehazi, “Kaula namwona yudya mvyele ywa Shunami eza. <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Sunguza guluka ukadugane naye umlamse, ‘Wivihi? Mgosiwo evihi? Mwanawo evihi?’” Ivyo, Gehaza eze aite na kumlamsa mvyele uyo Mshunami niyo ahitula, “Chiwedi.” <verse eid="2KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Eze abule kolugulu kwa mntu ywa Chohile niyo amtoza iviga, Gegazi asogela chani amuse, mna Elisha amgamba, “Mleke kwaviya ana chinyulu chitendese, naye Zumbe Chohile hanigambile imbuli iyo.” <verse eid="2KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Mvyele uyo amgamba Elisha, “Sekulu ywangu, togola miye sikulombeza mwana? Sikugambile usekuninka msuhi naunilumize umoyo nyumani?” <verse eid="2KI 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Elisha niyo amgamba Gehazi, “Guha inkome yangu usunguze kuhalawa. Usekuchimala mwesila kulamsa mntu yoyose, naho mntu yoyose nakulamse mwesila usekumwitikila. Kagoneze inkome yangu mwe chinengo cho umwana.” <verse eid="2KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Yudya mvyele amgamba Elisha, “Nelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, chindedi sahwase.” Ivyo, Elisha enuka aitanya na uyo mvyele. <verse eid="2KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gehazi nendile kawalongoila, eze abule aika inkome ya Elisha mlanga mwe chinengo cho umwana, mna chilagiso chochose cha ujima hachilaile. Auya adugana na Elisha amgamba, “Umwana hauyuke.” <verse eid="2KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Elisha eze abule, niyo engila kwechumba ichedu, amwona yudya mwana kalambala mlanga mo lusazi kabanika. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Ivo, kavugala ulwivi amlombeza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Niyo agona mlanga mwa yudya mwana, mlomo wakwe aubantika mo mlomo wa yudya mwana, meso yakwe mwa meso yo mwana, mikono yakwe mwe mikono yo umwana. Umo achei mlanga mwa yudya mwana, mwili wa uyo mwana niyo wakonga kubwikana moto. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Elisha niyo achimala akonga kujenda jenda mwe chumba, akajika niyo auya naho agona mlanga mo mwana. Yudya mwana niyo ajela mitisha nkanana mfungate, akaheza niyo agubula ameso. <verse eid="2KI 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Elisha niyo amwitanga Gehazi amgamba, “Mwitange nine dya yuno mwana.” Eze abule Elisha amgamba, “Mguhe mwanawo.” <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Niyo afunama mwe iviga vya Elisha kwa ntunyo amguha mwanawe afosa kuse.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpituko ntuhu adamanye Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Elisha auyaga kweisi ya Giligali kukatenda kuna gumbo. Zuwa dimwenga akawahinya bunga dya waoni, amgambaga mdima ywakwe, “Sika biga mwediziko uwambikile waoni.” <verse eid="2KI 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Yumwe ywawo niyo aita kwenkonde akwaha mboga. Uko niyo awona lusongabwa, niyo aha masongambwa yalozize viya adahile kwaha. Kaita nayo kayasenga senga na kuyajela mwedibiga heyamanyize ni mabwani. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Nkande niyo yomolwa. Mna weze walume wamwilila Elisha wamgamba, “Elisha nkande ino naichikome!” Wadunduga kuidya. <verse eid="2KI 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Elisha niyo alagiza egailwe unga, niyo egailwa, kaujela mndani mwe idibiga agamba, “Haluse wenkeni nkande wadye.” Niyo wadya hahana ahumile.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha alisa wantu gana dimwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Mntu yumwenga kulawa Baali Shalisha amwigailaga Elisha migage milongo midi idamanywe kwa shaili ya malimbulo yo ulozo wo mhilomo uwo na maiso mabisi ya ngano mwe juniya. Elisha niyo amlagiza Gehazi awenke awantu wadye <verse eid="2KI 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Mndima ywakwe niyo amgamba, “Saniwenke kwaviya haiwachinte wantu gana dimwenga.” Elisha niyo amgamba, “Wenke wadye, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kagamba nawadye wegute na intuhu naisigale.” <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Mndima ywakwe niyo awamalanyiza nkande, wose wadya na kwiguta, nkande ntuhu niyo yasigala, saviya mndima ywa Zumbe Chohile alongile.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Namani ahonywa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Namani mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa seuta ywa Alamu amanyikaga na kungiswa ni sekulu ywakwe, kwaviya kujinkila uyo, Zumbe Chohile nendile akainka uhuda isi iyo ya Alamu. Nendile ni mgomba nkondo mkankalu, mna nendila ana unyonje wa matana. <verse eid="2KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Mwe nkondo nendile wakagomba na wantu wa Izulaeli, wantu wa Alamu nendile waguha kandele kulawa Izulaeli, uyo niyo atende mndima ywa mkaza Namani. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Zuwa dimwenga niyo mndele uyo amgamba nine, mkaza Namani, “Hegu sekulu ywangu aitile akamwone yudya muwoni akwikala Samaliya nakamhonya amatana yakwe.” <verse eid="2KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Namani eze eve imbuli iyo, niyo aita kwa sekulu akumgambila ulosi ulongigwe ni kadya akandele. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Seuta ywa Alamu niyo amgamba, “Hita nanimtumile baluwa seuta ywa Izulaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:5">Namani niyo ahalawa kuno kaguha vihande elufu milongo mitatu vya mayuwe ya chumbu na vihande vya zahabu elufu mtandatu, naho na shuche ntana mlongo umwenga. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Ibaluwa iyo egale kwa seuta ywa Izulaeli nendile iwandikwa vino, “Ibaluwa ino ni chilagiso kwako cha mndima ywangu mkulu Namani, chani umhonye unyonje wakwe.”<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Mna seuta ywa Izulaeli eze asome ibaluwa iyo niyo atatula izisuche zakwe agamba, “Ni mbwani seuta ywa Alamu aunga nimlagule mntu ywakwe unyonje? Afanyanya miye ni Zumbe Chohile akudaha kukoma hegu kuuyusa? Kaulani mntu yuno anunga nkumbizi.”<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Elisha muwoni ywa Zumbe Chohile eze eve ulosi kugamba seuta ywa Izulaeli katatula izisuche zakwe, niyo egala ulosi kwa seuta amuza, “Ni mbwani kutatula izisuche zako? Nigaila uyo umntu, chani amanye kugamba kwe isi ya Izulaeli kuna muwoni.”<verse eid="2KI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Namani niyo aita na falasi ne myutuka yakwe kubula ko lwivi lwe inyumba ya Elisha. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Elisha niyo asigila mndima ywakwe akamgambile, “Hita ukahake ko mto wa Yolodani nkanana mfungate, nkanda yo mwili wako nayuye, nohone vitendese.” <verse eid="2KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Mna Namani niyo emukwa ni maya vitendese, ahalawa zakwe akagamba, “Nahagamba nanibase amlombeze Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywakwe, ajise imikono yakwe muno mwa matana chani anihonye! <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Imito ya Abana na Falipali ya uko Damesiki, ni yedi kujinka imito yose ya Izulaeli, Togola sadahile kuhaka umo niyo nahona?”, Niyo ahituka ahalawa chimayamaya. <verse eid="2KI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Wandima wakwe niyo wambasa wamgamba, “Sekulu ywetu hegu muwoni akugambile udamanye mbuli siku ndala, togola hwaidamanye? Haluse, icho akugambile du ni kugamba, ‘Kwesunte chani uhone!’ ” <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Ivyo, Namani niyo asela ko mto wa Yolodani etubwiza nkanana mfungate, saviya alagizwe ni Elisha mntu ywa Chohile, niyo ahona. Inkanda yakwe ideleka saviya ya mwana mteke. <verse eid="2KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Namani na awandima wakwe niyo wauya kwa Elisha, agamba, “Haluse simanya kugamba hahana Chohile yoyose mna Chohile ywa Izulaeli uyodu, ivyo haluse hampu hokela amalavyo ya miye mndima ywako.” <verse eid="2KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Elisha ahitula, “Nelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohle mta ujima uyo husankanila, kugamba sanihokele malavyo yoyose.” Namani amlahiliza na kumweila, mna Elisha niyo ajendeleza kulemela. <verse eid="2KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Namani agamba, “Hegu amalavyo yangu hoyahokele, hampu mwinke mndima ywako ulongo ukudaha kwinulwa ni mpunda mbili, kwaviya kukongela vino dyelo miye mndima ywako sanilavye malavyo ya kutikimya hegu ntambiko kwa milungu mituhu mna kwa Zumbe Chohile uyodu. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Zumbe Chohile anilekeile hatimilana na seuta ywangu kwita kokuvika kwenyumba ya Limoni mnungu ywa Alamu. Namlombeza Zumbe Chohile anilekeile!” <verse eid="2KI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Elisha amgamba, “Hita kwa utondowazi” Namani niyo aita zakwe. <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />Umo Namani henati kubula hale, Gehazi mndima ywa Elisha mntu ywa Chohile, elongela chimoyo moyo, “Kaula sekulu ywangu kamleka Namani, yuno ywa Alamu ahalawe vihufu hahokole vintu egale. Haluse kwa ukanuni nelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, namgulukila henkigwe chintu kulawa kwakwe.” <verse eid="2KI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Niyo ahalawa ambasa Namani. Namani eze akaule awona mntu akumgulukila, niyo asela mwe idilingisha dyakwe aita akudugana naye. Niyo amuza, “Togola ni kwedi?” <verse eid="2KI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Gegazi ahitula, “Mbuli zose zichuma, mna sekulu ywangu kanilagiza hugambile kugamba ivino haluse kahokela wajeni waidi wa bunga dya waoni mweisi ya amagulu ya Efulaimu, haluse aunga umwinke matundu elufu ntatu na suche mbili ntana.” <verse eid="2KI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Namani ahitula, “Chindedi, guha matundu elufu mtandatu.” Amweila azihokele, amvungila mavunje maidi na kumwinka suche mbili ntana, awenka wandima waidi mgati mwa awandima wakwe awalagiza wamsindikize Gehazi. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Weze wabule kolugulu akwikala Elisha, Gehazi niyo aguha amavunje ye izihela kulawa kwa awandima wa Namani ayegala kunyumba kwakwe. Vikaheza awaleka wadya awandima waite zawo, awo niyo wahalawa. <verse eid="2KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Akajika Gehazi niyo engila kunyumba kwa Elisha akonga kumsankanila. Elisha niyo amuza, “Nakwita kuhi?” Gehazi ahitula, “Nendile sitile hantu hohose.” <verse eid="2KI 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Mna Elisha niyo amgamba, “Togola iloho yangu hayendile hamwenga na weye umo yudya mntu akasela mwe idilingisha dyakwe na kwiza kudugana na weye? Chino ni chipindi cha kuhokela hela na suche na nkonde za mizaituni na ngoto na ng'ombe hegu wandima wa chigosi na wachiche? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Ivyo amatana ya Namani yakwikwingile weye na awelekwa wako mazuwa yose.” Elo, Gehazi niyo ahalawa akatenda katozwa ni matana, nkanda yakwe itenda ing'ala chweee.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Hoya yavululwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Zuwa dimwenga dya waoni wamfuzumilaga Elisha wakagamba, “Hantu hano chikwikala ni hadodo hachikwenela!. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Haluse leka chite Yolodani chikakante zengo chila mntu azenge hantu hakwe hakumwenela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Elisha niyo awahitula “Hitani.”<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Yumwenga mgati mwawo niyo amgamba, “Nakweila hampu hita na awandima wako.” Niyo azumila, <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />elo niyo aita hamwenga nawo, weze wabule ko mto wa Yolodani niyo wakonga kukanta idizengo. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Umo wakakanta imiti yumwenga ywawo, ihoya yakwe niyo yasomoka mo mhini yagwela mwe mazi, aho niyo akonga kwila akagamba, “Haluse sekulu ywangu nitende zeze? Hoya ino chita kuilombeza!”<verse eid="2KI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Elisha niyo amuza, “Igwela hahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:6">Niyo amlagisa aho igwele. Elisha niyo afyola kaziti akadula ahadya hagwele ihoya, ihoya niyo yeleleka mlanga mwa amazi. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Elisha niyo amlagiza ivulule naye niyo achulusa umkono aivulula.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagomba nkondo wa Alamu wahudwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Nendile hana nkondo ya Waalamu na Waizulaeli. Niyo seuta ywa Alamu alafya na awandima wakwe vilongozi, agamba, “Nkambi yangu naitende hantu hasiku.” <verse eid="2KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Mna Elisha niyo amwigaila ulosi seuta ywa Izulaeli akaulise, kwaviya Waalamu wemalanya kale wahebunge ahantu aho. <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Niyo seuta ywa Izulaeli egala wagomba nkondo wakwe hajihi na ahantu aho agambilwe. Elisha niyo ajendeleza kumfunda seuta emalanye kwa nkondo. Imbuli iyo ilaila nkanana zilozize.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Seuta ywa Alamu niyo ehiwa vidala mwe imbuli iyo. Kawetanga awakulu wa awagomba nkondo wakwe, niyo awauza, “Mnigambile ni yuhi mgati mwenu akutenda ntendele ya seuta ywa Izulaeli?”<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Yumwenga ywawo niyo ahitula, “Hahana akutenda ntendele yakwe, weye seuta. Akudamanya viya ni Elisha, muwoni akutenda kudya Izulaeli. Uyo amgambila seuta ywa Izulaeli mbuli zose ukulonga hata ukatenda kwechumba chako ukugona.” <verse eid="2KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Seuta ywa Alamu awagamba, “Hitani mkamlonde uko eli, miye nanisigile wantu waite wakamgwile.” Elo, eze agambilwe Elisha ekomzi wa Dosani, <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />seuta niyo egala bunga dya wagomba nkondo walozize hamwenga na malingisha. Bunga idyo dibula nechilo niyo dyautandama umzi. <verse eid="2KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Zuwa ditimile mtondo wakwe, mndima ywa Elisha asunguzaga kwinuka na kufosa kuse, niyo awona bunga dya wagomba nkondo na falasi na malingisha watandama umzi. Niyo auya kunyumba amgamba Elisha, “Sekulu ywangu file yetu ibula! Haluse chatenda zeze?” <verse eid="2KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Elisha niyo amhitula, “Usekogoha kwaviya awo nawachambize waloza kujinka awo nawawambize.” <verse eid="2KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Elisha niyo alombeza, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, mgubule ameso chani awone!” Zumbe Chohile niyo amgubula ameso uyo mbwanga, awona falasi na myutuka ya moto imema chila hantu mo ulugulu lose, vimzunguluka Elisha. <verse eid="2KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Wagomba nkondo wa Ashule weze wamsogeile Elisha, niyo alombeza vituhu agamba, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, nakulombeza watende matuntu wano awantu!” Zumbe Chohile niyo azumila idilombezo dya Elisha awatenda matuntu awo awantu. <verse eid="2KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Elisha niyo awabasa awagamba, “Mwaga sila, mzi mkulonda suwo uno. Ntimilani niwegaleni kwa uyo mkulonda.” Niyo awalongoza kubula Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Ahadya weze wengile momzi, Elisha niyo alombeza, “Weye Zumbe Chohile nakulombeza wagubule ameso wano awantu chani wawone.” Zumbe Chohile niyo azumila idilombezo dya Elisha, awagubula ameso awantu awo. Wakaule wawona wehagatigati homzi wa Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Seuta ywa Izulaeli eze awawone awo Awaalamu, amuza Elisha, “Togola sekulu niwakome?” <verse eid="2KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Elisha niyo amhitula, “Waleke usekuwakoma. Wano wantu huwatahile kwa kugomba nkondo nawo, wenke nkande wadye na mazi wanywe, ukaheza waleke wauye kwa sekulu ywawo.” <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Seuta ywa Izulaeli niyo awadamanyiza ngasu nkulu, weze waheze ukudya na ukunywa, niyo awavuza kwa sekulu ywawo. Kukongela ichipindi icho awantu wa Alamu hawayebungile isi ya Izulaeli kwa chipindi chitali.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagomba nkondo wa Ashulu wautandama umzi wa Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Mna, nyumani seuta Beni Hadadi ywa Alamu niyo achisanya bunga dya wagomba nkondo wakwe wose aita akutandama umzi wa Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Ulailo wakwe mo umzi wa Samaliya niyo kwatendeka na gumbo ditendese. Mtwi wa mpunda naukatagwa kwa vihande vya chumbu milongo mnane na gilamu gana dimwenga za mavi ya wasuwamanga nazikatagwa kwa vihande vya chumbu vishano. <verse eid="2KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Zuwa dimwenga seuta ywa Izulaeli umo endaga akajenda mlanga mwe chiwambaza chomzi, evaga mvyele akamgamba, “Nambiza sekulu ywangu, nambiza!” <verse eid="2KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Seuta amgamba, “Zumbe Chohile hanakwambize, miye sanidahe kukwambiza. Kwaviya sina ngano hegu zabibu. <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Seuta amuza, hwambize mbwani?” Mvyele uyo niyo ahitula, “Mazuzi yuno mvyele kaniluvya chimdye mwanangu ukajika luvi nachimdye mwanawe. <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Ivyo mwanangu chimwambika na kumdya. Mtondo wakwe namgamba chimdye mwanawe, mna yeye nendile kamfisa!” <verse eid="2KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Seuta eze eve ulosi wa uyo mvyele, niyo atatula izisuche zakwe kwa chinyulu, wantu wendile haguhi ne ichiwambaza wawona kugamba seuta kundani nendile kavika juniya. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Niyo agamba, “Dyelo, Elisha mwana ywa Shafati hanakantigwe umtwi wakwe, Zumbe Chohile anikome!” <verse eid="2KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Niyo asigila mlosi aite akamguhe Elisha. Chipindi icho Elisha endaga kunyumba na wadalahala wamtalamkile. Mlosi uyo ywa seuta umo henati kubula, Elisha niyo awagamba wadya awadalahala,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:32">“Yudya mkomi kasigila mntu eze anikante umtwi! Anabula hano vugalani ulwivi, mnasekumleka akengila kunyumba. Kwaviya sekulu ywakwe amtimila mnyuma.” <verse eid="2KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Iviya henati kubinda ukulonga, seuta niyo abula, agamba, “Uchiwa uno ulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile! Ni mbwani nijendeleze kumgoja vituhu?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Elisha niyo amhitula, “Tegeleza ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile, ‘Luvi chipindi sachino, muno momzi wa Samaliya chilo ntatu za unga wedi wa ngano nautagwe kwa chihande chimwenga cha chumbu na makopo maidi ya shayili nayatagwe kwa chihande chimwenga cha shekeli mwe inchili yo umzi.’” <verse eid="2KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Sekulu mkanuni ywa seuta niyo amgamba Elisha, “Hata hegu Zumbe Chohile mwenye adamanye madilisha kwembingu, togola mbuli saiyo naidahike!” Elisha niyo amhitula, “Kwameso yako nauwone, mna haudye.”<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagomba nkondo wa Alamu wahalawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Kwendaga na wantu wane wata unyonje wa matana uko kwe izinyivi zo umzi wa Samaliya, awo wagambilana wowo wenye, “Ni mbwani chekala hano chafa sala? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Hata chikengila komzi ni vyabule kwaviya uko nachife. Ivyo chiteni kwenkambi ya wantu wa Alamu, vyadahika nawachikome hegu wasekuchikoma.” <verse eid="2KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Ivyo, chiza chize chikonge kwingila, niyo waita kwe inkambi ya awantu wa Alamu, mna weze wabule uko, wakaule! Hawabwile mntu. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />Zumbe Chohile kaditenda idibunga dya awagomba nkondo wa Alamu weve izwi saviya wagomba nkondo walozize wendile na myutuka na falasi. Wagomba nkondo wa Alamu nawafanyanya kugamba seuta ywa Izulaeli kagoneka wagomba nkondo Wahiti na Wamisili weze wawebunge. <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Ivyo, mwe ichilo icho, Waalamu wose niyo wasumka chani wahonye ujima wawo, wasa amahema yawo, falasi ne izimpunda zawo, hata inkambi wayasa ichedu wogoha file. <verse eid="2KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Wadya wata amatana awane weze wabule mwe mpembe ye inkambi, niyo wengila mwe hema dimwenga, wadya na kunywa viya wabwile umo, wakaheza waguha hela na zahabu na suche wazifisa. Wengila kwehema tuhu wadamanya seivyo. <verse eid="2KI 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Mna niyo wagambilana, “Chino chikudamanya sicho chedi! Ino ni mbuli yedi chinanayo dyelo, hegu chinagoja kubula mtondo chadaha chikantilwe. Chisunguze kwita chigambile wantu kwenyumba ya seuta!” <verse eid="2KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Ivyo, niyo wahalawa he inkambi ya Waalamu waita kwa wamizi womzi na kuwagamba, “Nachita kwenkambi ya wagomba nkondo wa Alamu, mna hachiwone hegu kwiva mntu yoyose. Falasi ne izimpunda zichei zitalizwa, amahema yawo ni saviya wayasize.” <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Wamizi womzi niyo wakulonga ulosi uwo kubula kwenyumba ya seuta. <verse eid="2KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Seuta eze eve ulosi uwo iviya kuchei chilo niyo enuka awagambila masekulu wakwe, “Miye simanya umwalo wa Waalamu! Wamanya kuno komzi china gumbo, haluse wasa inkambi yawo waita wakwefisa kwezinkonde chani umo chinaita chikalonde nkande wachigwile chose chiwajima na kutaha umzi.”<verse eid="2KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Mna yumwenga ywa wadya amasekulu wakwe niyo agamba, “Wantu walozize muno monzi wafa sala kale. Haluse sigila wantu wajeche waite na falasi shano mwe ziya zisigale chani wakakaule icho chilaile.” <verse eid="2KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Niyo wasagula wantu na kuwenka myutuka midi. Seuta awasigila wawabase wagomba nkondo wa Alamu, awagamba, “Hitani mkakaule icho chilaile mwa awagomba nkondo wa Waalamu.” <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Wantu awo niyo wawatimila kubula Yolodani mwesila wawona suche na vimpandwa vituhu vyasigwe ni wagomba nkondo wa Alamu umo wakasumka. Niyo wauya wamgambila seuta ulosi wawone. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Wantu wa Samaliya niyo wafosa wataha inkambi ya Waalamu. Saviya Zumbe Chohile alongile, chilo shano za unga wedi wa ngano hegu chilo mlongo za shayili zitagwa kwa chihande chimwenga cha chumbu. <verse eid="2KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Seuta ywa Izulaeli nendile kaika sekulu yudya mwamizi ywakwe amile inchili yomzi. Sekulu uyo ajatagwa ni wantu aho henchili na kubanika saviya Elisha alongaga umo seuta aitaga kumuwona. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Elisha amgambaga seuta chipindi saicho zuwa naditimile, chilo shano za unga wedi wa ngano hegu chilo mlongo umwenga za shayili nazitagwe kwa chihande chimwenga cha chumbu, <verse eid="2KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />mna sekulu uyo amhigaga Elisha, akagamba, “Hata hegu Zumbe Chohile mwenye adamanye madilisha kwembingu, mbuli iyo haidahike.” Elisha niyo amhitula, “Weye nauwone yakalaila mna weye inkande iyo howidye” <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Ivyo nivyo vilaile sekulu uyo kabanika kwa kujatwa ni wantu kwe inchili yo mzi.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Mvyele kulawa Shunemu auya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Elisha eze amuyuse umwana ywa yudya mvyele nakekala komzi wa Shunemu, niyo amgamba uyo mvyele, “Zumbe Chohile kagwisa gumbo muno mweisi naditendeke kwa mihilimo mfungate, haluse nakulangiliza samila kwesi ntuhu weye na awantu wemwe inyumba yako.” <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Mvyele uyo niyo ahalawa na awantu wemwe inyumba yakwe saviya agambilwe ni Elisha mntu ywa Chohile aita akwikala saviya mjeni kwe isi ya Wafilisiti kwa mihilimo mfungate. <verse eid="2KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Mihilimo mfungate ize ijinke niyo akulawa kweisi ya Filisiti auya Izulaeli aita kwa seuta alombeza avuzizwe inyumba yakwe ne inkonde yakwe. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Yudya mvyele eze abule ambwila seuta alonga na Gehazi mndima ywa Elisha, amgamba, “Hampu nigambila izimpituko zikudamanywa ni Elisha.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Umo Gehazi achei kumgambila seuta ivyo Elisha auyuse mntu abanike, uyo mvyele niyo alonga idilombezo dyakwe kwa seuta. Gehazi niyo agamba, “Weye seuta, mvyele yuno nuyo mta umwana auyuswe ni Elisha!” <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Seuta eze amuze uyo mvyele, niyo amgambila ivyo alongile Gehazi ni chindedi. Seuta niyo amwitanga sekulu ywa awandima wakwe na kumlagiza kugamba, mvyele uyo avuzizwe ivintu vyakwe vyose hamwenga na ivyo vilawane mwe inkonde yakwe kwa mihilimo yose iyo mfungate umo hehali.<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha na seuta Beni Hadadi ywa Alamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Elisha niyo aita Damesiki. Chipindi icho seuta Beni Hadadi endaga mnyonje, eze agambilwe kugamba Elisha eyuko Damesiki, <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />niyo amgamba Hazaeli yumwe mwa amasekulu ywa awandima wakwe, “Mwigaile majeleko mntu ywa Chohile mgambe aunge ulangilizi kwa Zumbe Chohile kugamba nanihone hegu bule.” <verse eid="2KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Ivyo, Hazaeli niyo akweza majeleko yesimane mwe ngamiya milongo mine amwigaila Elisha. Eze abule kwa Elisha amgamba, “Mndima ywako Beni Hadadi seuta ywa Alamu kanituma kwako huze unyonje wakwe nahone hegu bule?” <verse eid="2KI 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Elisha niyo amhitula, “Hita kamgambe chindedi nahone, mna Zumbe Chohile kanilagisa kugamba nabanike.” <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Aho, Elisha niyo amfantwila meso akatenda na nkama, vyamhosa Hazaeli engilwe ni nkama. Chimpumpa, Elisha mntu ywa Chohile niyo akonga kwila. <verse eid="2KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Hazaeli niyo amuza, “Sekulu ywangu walizwa ni mbwani?” Elisha ahitula, “Kwaviya simanya ivihiye ukunga uwadamanyize awantu wa Izulaeli. Notikimye izingome zawo, wabwanga wawo nowakome, wana wawo nauwahonde, wavyele wasoka nowatumbule.” <verse eid="2KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Hazaeli niyo amuza, “Miye mndima ywako nisaviya kuli du, nanidahe vivihi kutenda mbuli nkulu saizo?” Elisha niyo amhitula, “Zumbe Chohile kanilagisa kugamba notende seuta ywa Alamu.” <verse eid="2KI 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Hazaeli niyo ahalawa auya kwa sekulu ywakwe. Seuta Beni Hadadi niyo amuza, “Elisha kakugaze?” Hazaeli amhitula, “Kanigamba chindedi nohone” <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Mna zuwa ditimile Hazaeli niyo aguha mgolole uzamile adilweka mwe mazi, akaheza amgubika nadyo mouso kubula abanika. Beni Hadadi eze abanike, Hazaeli niyo alongoza Alamu.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Yeholamu ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Mo mhimo wa shano wo ulongozi wa Yolamu mwana ywa Ahabu, seuta ywa Izulaeli, Yeholamu mwana ywa Yehoshefati, akongaga kulongoza mweisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Kakonga kulongoza akatenda na mihulimo milongo mitatu na midi. Kalongoza uko Yelusalemu kwa mihilimo mnane. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Katimila sila zihiye za amaseuta awatuhu wa Waizulaeli. Saviya wantu we ikaya ya Ahabu watendile, kwaviya mkaziwe endaga ni mchiche ywa Ahabu. Niyo adamanya yehiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />mna Zumbe Chohile haungile kuwakoma awantu wa Yuda, kwaviya nakaika ndagano kugamba welekwa wa mndima ywakwe Daudi, nawajendeleze kulongoza mazuwa yose. <verse eid="2KI 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Umo Yeholamu akalongoza wantu wa Edomu niyo wauhituka ulongozi wa Yuda, vyaleka wasagula seuta ywawo. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Ivyo, Yeholamu na wagomba nkondo na amalingisha yakwe yose wahalawaga waita Zaili. Nechilo afosaga na masekulu wakwe wa amalingisha wawebunga Waedomu wendaga wamtandama, mna awagomba nkondo wakwe niyo wafifinya wasumka wauya kwe izikaya zawo. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Ivyo, awantu wa Edomu wauhituka ulongozi wa Yuda kubula vino haluse. Mwe ichipindi icho wekazi wo umzi wa Libina, nawo niyo wahitukila. <verse eid="2KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Mbuli zose ntuhu adamanye seuta Yeholamu ziwandikwe mwe ichitabu cha mbuli za Lukumbusa za amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Yeholamu niyo abanika ahambwa kweizimbila za amaseuta komzi wa Daudi, mwanawe dya Yeholamu akwitangwa Ahaziya niyo atenda seuta hantu hakwe.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Ahaziya ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 22:1-6">2Mihilimo 22:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Mo mhilimo wa mlongo na midi wo ulongozi Yolamu mwana ywa Ahabu seuta ywa Izulaeli, Ahaziya mwana ywa Yeholamu seuta ywa Yuda akongaga kulongoza. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ahaziya akongaga kulongoza akatenda na mihilimo milongo midi na midi, kalongoza komzi wa Yelusalemu kwa mhilimo umwenga. Nine naketangwa Ataliya mchiche ywa seuta Ahabu na endaga mwezukulu ywa seuta Omli ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Kwaviya Ahaziya endaga mkwelima ywa awantu we ikaya ya Ahabu, katimila lujendo lwa awantu awo we ikaya ya Ahabu, kadamanya mbuli zihiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, saviya awantu we ikaya ya Ahabu wadamanye. <verse eid="2KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Seuta Ahaziya niyo aita hamwenga na Yolamu mwana ywa Ahabu seuta ywa Izulaeli wakugomba nkondo na Hazaeli seuta ywa Alamu uko Lamoti Giliyadi, Wagomba nkondo wa Alamu niyo wamlumiza Yolamu mwe inkondo. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Vikaheza, Seuta Yolamu niyo auya komzi wa Yezileli chani atabanwe izinkwenje zakwe alumizwe uko komzi wa Lama mo ukugomba nkondo na Hazaeli seuta ywa Alamu. Ahaziya niyo aita akamkaule Yolamu uko komzi wa Yezileli kwaviya nendile ni mnyonje.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Yehu atenda seuta ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Chipindi icho, muwoni ywa Chohile Elisha amwitangaga yumwenga ywa waoni, amgamba, “Kwemalanye wite Lamoti uko Giliyadi. Guha ino isupa ya amavuta, <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />ukabula uko, mlonde Yehu mwana ywa Yehoshefati endaga mwezukulu ywa Nimshi. Mguhe mwigale kwechumba che ichedu, hehene weyawe, <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />ukaheza mjele yano amavuta mo mtwi wakwe, umgambe, ‘Zumbe Chohile agamba sikujela mavuta chani utende seuta ywa Izulaeli.’ Ukajika vugula ulwivi usunguze halawe ivyo nodahe.” <verse eid="2KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Ivyo, mbwanga uyo muwoni niyo aita Lamoti Giliyadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Eze abule, kawabwila masekulu wa wagomba nkondo hechitala. Niyo agamba, “Sekulu naunga hugambile ulosi wako.” Yehu niyo amuza, “Mwasuwe hano ni yuhi ukumgambila?” Amhitula, “Sekulu nalonga na weye.” <verse eid="2KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Wose waidi niyo wengila mndani mwe ichumba, uko muwoni uyo ywa Chohile niyo amjela mavuta Yehu momtwi amgamba, “Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli, agamba, ‘Nakujela mavuta utende seuta ywa awantu wangu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Uwakome awantu wemwekaya ya sekulu ywako Ahabu chani nimlihize Yezebeli chikoda cha kuwakoma awandima wangu waoni na awandima wangu watuhu wose. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Wantu wose we ikaya ya Ahabu na welekwa wawo wa chilume nowakome. Naho nanimkome chila mntu ywe ikaya ya Ahabu mkulu hegu mdodo. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Wantu we ikaya yakwe nawatende saviya wantu we ikaya ya Yeloboamu mwana ywa Neboti na awantu we ikaya ya Baasha mwana ywa Ahiya. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Hahana mntu namhambe Yezebeli, chimba chakwe nachidigwe ni makuli mweisi ya Yezieli.’” Muoni uyo eze abinde kulonga ivyo niyo afosa kulawa kwechumba, aguluka. <verse eid="2KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Yehu eze auye kwa aweyawe, yumwenga ywawo niyo amuza, “Uko ni kwedi? Yuno mchilalu aunga mbwani kwako?” Yehu awahitula “Uyo kehabwanta du.” <verse eid="2KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Wowo wamgamba, “Icho sicho chindedi! Chigambile icho alongile!” Awagamba, “Kanigamba Zumbe Chohile kagamba, ‘Sikusagula utende seuta ywa Izulaeli.’” <verse eid="2KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Aho masekulu wa awagomba nkondo weyawe niyo wahambula amakazu yawo, wazitantalika mwe ntantilo chani achimale mlanga mwakwe, niyo watowa magunda na kulonga, “Yehu ni seuta!”<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Yolamu ywa Izulaeli akomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Yehu mwana ywa Yehoshafati iviya endaga mwezukulu ywa Nimshi, amfungilaga njama Yolamu, Yolamu na wantu wose wa Izulaeli wendaga Lamoti Giliyadi wakaudima umzi usekutahwa ni seuta Hazaeli ywa Alamu. <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />Mna seuta Yolamu nendile kauya komzi wa Yezieli chani auguze izinkenje apatile kwenkondo nawakagomba na Hazaeli seuta ywa Alamu. Yehu niyo awagamba maseku wa nkondo weyawe, “Uneva chinevana nyuwe na miye, mntu yoyose asekufosa Lamoti kwita Yezieli kwigala ulosi uno kuganmba miye ni seuta.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Aho, niyo akwela mwe idilingisha dyakwe ahinga Yezieli. Yolamu nendile hanati kuhona, seuta Ahaziya ywa Yuda nendile eyaho kamtalamkila. <verse eid="2KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Mwamizi ywe uluzo kulanga komnala wa Yezieli niyo agamba, “Nawona wantu wakwiza na lingisha!” Yolamu niyo ahitula, “Sagula mkwela falasi yumwenga umtume chani akadugane nawo, awauze ‘Weza kwa utondowazi?’” <verse eid="2KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Ivyo, mlosi uyo eze aite niyo adugana na Yehu, amgamba, “Seuta auza kuna utondowazi?” Yehu ahitula, “Ni mbwani wauza ivyo? Weye hituka unitimile!” Mwamizi kulanga komnala niyo agamba seuta, “Mlosi kawabwila, mna hakuya.” <verse eid="2KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Ivyo, seuta Yolamu niyo asigila mlosi ywa kaidi, iviya kamuza Yehu ulosi saudya auzigwe ni mlosi ywa nkongo. Yehu niyo ahitula seiviya, “Ni mbwani wauza hegu kuna utondowazi? Weye hitula unitimile!” <verse eid="2KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Yudya mwamizi niyo alonga vituhu, “Mlosi kawabwila mna hakuya.” Akaheza niyo ongezeza, “Myendesheze ye idilingisha nisaviya ya Yehu mwana ywa Nimshi, kwaviya Yehu afulusha idilingisha.” <verse eid="2KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Elo, Yolamu seuta ywa Izulaeli niyo alagiza kugamba, “Malanya idilingisha.” Awo niyo wamalanya idilingisha dyakwe. Wakaheza Yolamu seuta ywa Izulaeli na Ahaziya seuta ywa Yuda wahalawa chila yumwenga kakwela idilingisha dyakwe, waita wakudugana na Yehu. Wambwila mwe chiwasa cha Naboti mntu ywa Yezieli. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Yolamu eze amuwone Yehu, niyo amuza, “Yehu kuna utondowazi?” Yehu niyo amhitula, “Utondowazi ulawe kuhi, kuno wavilanga na wasai wa mama yako Yezebeli waloza?” <verse eid="2KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Ivyo, Yolamu niyo ahitula idilingisha dyakwe na kuhalawa, kuno amgamba Ahaziya, “Ahaziya uno ni ubanasi!” <verse eid="2KI 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Yehu niyo aguha uta wakwe niyo adula mvulo ufifinye hagati ha amayega ya Yolamu na kumtunga mo moyo wakwe, niyo abanika mlanga mwe idilingisha dyakwe. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Yehu niyo amgamba mwambaizi ywakwe Bidikali, “Guha icho ichimba chakwe uchidule mweiyo inkonde ya Naboti mntu ywa Yezieli. Nafanyanya kugamba wakumbuka viya Zumbe Chohile alongile imilosi ino mwakwe umo weye na miye chakweile mwefalasi yetu mnyuma mwa Ahabu ise dyo Yolamu. <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />Zumbe Chohile alongaga, ‘Kwa udya ukomi wa a Naboti na wanawe niwone mazuwa yajinkile nelisa kugamba nahulihize chikoda mwe inkonde iyo.’ Ivyo, guha ichimba icho cha Yolamu uchidule mweinkonde ya Naboti saviya Zumbe Chohile alongile.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Ahaziya ywa Yuda akomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Ahaziya seuta ywa Yuda eze awone ayo yalaile niyo asumka ahinga komzi wa Beti Hagani, kuno atimilwa ni Yehu. Yehu niyo awalagiza awantu wakwe, “Uyo naye mkomeni!” Awo niyo wamtunga mfulo akatenda emwe idilingisha dyakwe kweisila ikukwela kwita Guli hajihi noumzi wa Ibuleamu. Niyo ademadema asmkila Megido akubanikila uko. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Awambizi wakwe niyo waguha ichimba chakwe mndani mwe idilingisha dyakwe wachigala Yelusalemu, uko niyo wamhamba kwe izimbila ze chiseuta komzi wa Daudi.<verse eid="2KI 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Ahaziya akongaga kulongoza Yuda mo mhilimo wa mlongo na umwenga wo useuta wa Yolamu mwana ywa Ahabu.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malikiya Yezebeli akomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Yehu eze abule Yezilieli, Yezebeli nendile keva kale ulosi we izimbuli zilaile. Ehakaga wanja mwa ameso na kuchana izifili zakwe, niyo aita kwedidilisha akaula hasi. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Umo akengila kwenchili Yezebeli niyo agamba, “Weye wi savya Zimli kwa wedi! Weye ukukoma awakulu wako?” <verse eid="2KI 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Yehu niyo asinya kulanga na kugamba, “Ni yuhi entendele yangu?” Masekulu waidi hegu watatu niyo walaviza imitwi yawo kulawa mwe dilisha wamkaula Yehu, <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Yehu niyo agamba mduleni hasi uyo mvyele yamyalika intuhu mlanga mwe ichiwambaza ne intuhu mwe izifalasi umo zikamjatajata ne izingaga zawo, <verse eid="2KI 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />vikaheza, Yehu niyo engila mwe idizumba dye chiseuta, uko niyo adya na kunywa. Alagiza kugamba, “Mhambeni uyo mvyele aligitwe, kwaviya ni mchiche ywa seuta.” <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Mna, awantu weze waite chani wakamhambe, wabwila ingobela yo umtwi na amavuha ye ivifumba no ulwayo ivyodu. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Wakaheza niyo wauya wamgambila ulosi uyo Yehu, uyo niyo agamba, “Ivyo nivyo Zumbe Chohile alongaga kujinkila mndima ywakwe Eliya mntu ywa Tishibi akagamba, ‘Makuli nayadye ichimba cha Yezebeli mweisi ya Yezilieli. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Ichimba cha Yezebeli nachimwaganike saviya mavi mwe nkonde mwe isi ya Yezileli, ivyo hahana mntu nammanye.’”<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Ahabu wakomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Komzi wa Samaliya kwendaga na welekwa wa chilume milongo mfungate wa Ahabu. Yehu niyo awandika baluwa nakuzigala kwa masekulu na kwa vilongozi womzi na kwawamizi wa awana wa Ahabu. Baluwa iyo iwandikwa vino. <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />“Kwaviya mgati mwenyu mna wana wa seuta, iviya mna falasi na malingisha na viziha na mizi izengelwe ngome. Ivyo aho nahokele ibaluwa ino, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />msagule na kumwika mta udahi utendese mgati mwa awana wa seuta atende seuta, mkaheza gombani nkondo kwa chausa cha ulukolo lwe ikaya ya seuta.” <verse eid="2KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Vilongozi wa Samaliya wogohaga vitendese na kugamba, “Nachidahe vivihi kumtowa Yehu kuno seuta Yolamu na seuta Ahaziya wamdunduga?” <verse eid="2KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Ivyo sekulu mkulu ywe inyumba ya seuta na sekulu mkulu ywo umzi, wakambizana na vilongozi watuhu na wamizi, niyo wamwigaila Yehu ulosi uno, “Suwe chiwandima wako, naho chemalanya kudanya dyodyose ukulonga. Mna hachike mntu yoyose atende seuta. Damanya viya ukuwona vyawagila.” <verse eid="2KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Yehu niyo awawandikila baluwa ntuhu awagamba, “Hegu chindedi mwemalanya kale kudamanya malagizo yangu, nigailani imitwi ya awana wa sekulu ywenyu hano ho umzi wa Yezieli, luvi sazino niiwone.” Wana awo milongo mfungate wa Ahabu wendaga wakekala kwa vilongozi wa Samaliya awo wendaga wakawatunduliya. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Ivyo, ibaluwa ya Yehu ize iwabwile niyo wawakoma awo awana wose milongo mfungate wa seuta, mitwi yawo niyo waijela mwe ntangulu wamwigaila Yehu uko Yezieli. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Mlosi yumwenga niyo ambasa seuta Yehu amgamba, “Imitwi ya awana wa seuta Ahabu iletwa kale.” Seuta niyo alagiza, “Ikeni hasi kwe inchili yo umzi mafungu maidi, mkaheza ilekeni isigaile uko kubula luvi mtondo.” <verse eid="2KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Mtondo wakwe niyo afosa achimala na kuwagamba wantu wose, “Nyuwe mwatimila chiya mkugambilwa, miye sidya njama na kumkoma sekulu ywangu Yolamu. Mna ni yuhi awakomile wano wose? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Manyani kugamba milosi yose alongile Zumbe Chohile kuwalanga awantu we ikaya ya Ahabu ichinta. Zumbe Chohile kadamanya yadya alongile kujinkila mndima ywakwe Eliya.” <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Yehu niyo akoma welekwa watuhu wasigale we inyumba ya Ahabu nawakekala Yezieli, hamwenga na masekulu wakwe na wambuyaze na walavyantambiko wakwe, hasigaze mntu yoyose.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walukolo wa seuta Ahaziya wakomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Yehu niyo akulawa Yezieli ahinga Samaliya. Umo achei emwesila hantu hakwitangwa, “Nkambi ya wadimi,” <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />adugana na wantu we ikaya ya mta ukwaga Ahaziya seuta ywa Yuda, niyo awauza, “Nyuwe ni nyuwe wahi?” Wamhitula, “Suwe chiwantu we ikaya ya Ahaziya. Chisela kuno chiwahani awana wa seuta na awana wa Yezebeli mkaza seuta Ahabu.” <verse eid="2KI 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Vikaheza, Yehu niyo awalagiza awantu wakwe agamba, “Wagwileni wachei wajima.” Niyo wawagwila wantu milongo mine na waidi, wawakomela hajihi ne idisima dye “Nkambi ya Wadimi.” Hahasigale hata mntu yumwenga.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walukolo wose wasigale wa Ahabu wakomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Yehu niyo afosa vituhu mwesila adugana na Yehonadabu mwana ywa Lekabu, Yehu niyo amlamsa, akaheza amgamba, “Weye una fanyanyi zikuligana na izangu? Togola nolungane na miye unambize?” Yehonadabu niyo amhitu, “Heye, nanelunge na weye.” Yehu niyo amgamba, “Ninka umkono wako” Niyo watozana imikono, Yehu niyo amkweza mwe idilingisha dyakwe. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Yehu niyo amgamba, “Timilana na miye chani uwone ivyo ni mkanuni kwa Zumbe Chohile.” Elo, niyo watamba hamwenga mwe idilingisha dyakwe waita Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Weza wabule Samaliya, Yehu niyo awakoma awalukolo wose wa Ahabu hasigaze hata yumwenga. Niyo vyatenda saviya Zumbe Chohile amgambile Eliya ivyo navitende.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wakuvikila Milungu yo udanti wakomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Yehu niyo awachisanya awantu wa Samaliya awagamba, “Seuta Ahabu amsankanilaga mnungu Baali hadodo du, mna miye nanimsankanile vitendese. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Haluse wetangeni, wadya wose wakumvikila mnungu Baali na walavyantambiko wakwe. Vyaungwa chila yumwenga abule, kwaviya naunga nimvikile Baali mviko mkulu, yoyose naswese kubula nakomwe.” Iyo yendaga njama ya Yehu chani awakome wadya wose wakumvikila mnungu Baali. <verse eid="2KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Yehu niyo alagiza, “Itangani mdugano mkulu wa kumvikila mnungu Baali!” Lugong'ondo niyo lwatoigwa, <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Yehu niyo atuma ulosi mweisi yose ya Izulaeli chani wantu wose wakumvikila mnungu Baali chila yumwenga abule. Niyo wose weza na kumema mwenyumba yo kumvikila mnungu Baali kulawa mpembe imwenga kubula ntuhu. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Aho, Yehu niyo amlagiza yudya mlavyantambiko achimaile izisuche zisentigwe akamgamba, “Lavya izo izisuche uwenke awantu wezile ho mviko wo kumvikila mnungu Baali.” Uyo mchimaila niyo alavya izo izisuche na kuwenka. <verse eid="2KI 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Akaheza Yehu niyo engila mwe inyumba yo kumvikila mnungu Baali akatenda kalongozana na Yehonadabu, kuwagamba wadya wendile umo mwenyumba yo kuvikila, “Manyani kugamba wantu we mndani mwenyumba yo kuvikila ni wadya du wakumvikila mnungu Baali, na kugamba hamna mntu yoyose akumvila Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Akaheza niyo wengila hamwenga wamlavize malavyo na ntambiko za kutikimya mnungu Baali. Yehu nendile kaika wantu milongo mnane kuse kweinyumba yokuvikila na kuwenka amalagizo yano, “Wakomeni wano awantu wose. Yoyose namleke hata yumwenga asumke naakomwe!” <verse eid="2KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Ahadya Yehu eze abinde ukulavya ntambiko zo kutikimya, niyo awagamba awamizi na masekulu, “Ingilani mkawakome wose. Msekumleka hata yumwenga asumke!” Niyo wengila na mabamba yawo wawakoma wose, wakaheza niyo walavya ivimba vyawo kuse. Wakaheza niyo wengila kwechumba cho kuvikila, <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />na kuilavya kuse inguzo ikuvikilwa na kuitikimya moto. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Niyo wabalanga inguzo hamwenga ne inyumba yo kuvikila, nyumba iyo waihitula itenda choo, ivyo nivyo vili kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="2KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Ivyo nivyo Yehu alekeze miviko ya kumvikila mnungu Baali mweisi ya Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Mna Yehu halekile kukola masa sayadya adamanyaga Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebati ya kuwalongoza Waizulaeli wakole masa. Aikaga matukulu ya ndama ya zahabu uko Beteli na Dani. <verse eid="2KI 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Yehu, “Welekwa wa Ahabu kuwadamanyiza yadya yose nungile uwadamanyize. Ivyo sikwelisiza kugamba welekwa wako kubula cheleko cha kane nawalongoze Izulaeli.” <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Mna Yehu hatimile amalagizo ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli kwa moyo wakwe wose. Kakola masa sayadya akoile Yeloboamu awahosize wantu wa Izulaeli wakole masa.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yehu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Mwe ichipindi icho Zumbe Chohile akongaga kuhunguza ahantu he isi ya Izulaeli. Seuta Hazaeli ywa Alamu niyo aihuda ntendele nkulu ye isi ya Izulaeli, <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />kulawa ntendele yo ulailo wa zuwa yo umto wa Yolodani ne izisi za Giliyadi na Gadi na Lubeni na Manase na kulawa komzi wa Aloeli na kwe izisi za Giliyadi na Bashani. <verse eid="2KI 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Ntendwa ntuhu zose adamanye Yehu na ntendwa zakwe za ukankalu ziwandikwa mwe chitabu cho Lukumbusa cha Amaseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Niyo abanika na kuhambwa Samaliya. Mwanawe Yehoahazi niyo alongoza ise eze abanike. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Yehu kalongoza Izulaeli ekekala Samaliya kwa mihilimo milongo midi na mnane.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Malikiya Ataliya alongoza isi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Ahadya Ataliya nine dya seuta Ahaziya eze awone mwanawe kakomwa, niyo alagiza awantu wose we ikaya ye ichiseuta wakomwe. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Mna Yehosheba mchiche ywa seuta Yeholamu, lumbudye dya Ahaziya amguhaga chinyele Yoashi mwana ywa Ahaziya yumwenga dya awana wa seuta nendile wakaungwa wakomwe. Amfisaga hamwenga na mlezi ywakwe mwechumba cho kugona. Wamfisa chani Ataliya anase kumuwona na kumkoma. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Yoashi ekalaga naye kwa mihilimo mtandatu akatenda kamfisa mndani mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, umo Ataliya achei kulongoza mweisi. <verse eid="2KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Mna mo mhilimo wa mfungate Yehoyada mlavyantambiko niyo asigila ulosi na kuwachisanya wamizi wahajihi wa masekulu, kalagiza wambase kwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, niyo adamanya nawo wivano na kuwawapiza umo mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. Akaheza niyo awalagisa Yoashi mwana ywa seuta Ahaziya. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Akaheza niyo alagiza, “Umo namwizile kutoza uluzo lwenyu lwe Idizuwa dyo Kuhumula, wantu mabunga matatu mgati mwe mane nawamile idizumba dye ichiseuta, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />wantu mabunga matatu mgati mwe mane watuhu nawamile inchili ya Suli na wantu mabunga matatu mgati mwe mane watuhu nawatende kwenchili kunyuma kwa awamizi. Ivyo nivyo namwamile idizumba dye ichiseuta chani disekutulwa. <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Yadya amabunga amaidi yakubinda uluzo lwawo mwe idizuwa dyo Kuhumula nawatoze luzo mwe inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile wamwamile seuta. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Ikalani na seuta hohose natendeke, mumzunguluke chila mntu na chiziha chakwe mo mkono, mntu yoyose najeze kuwasogeilani mkomeni.” <verse eid="2KI 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Masekulu wa awamizi watimila amalagizo yose yalagizwe ni mlavyantambiko Yehoyada. Chila sekulu niyo aguha awantu wakwe wose, wadya wendile wakabinda uluzo lwawo na wadya nawakengila kutoza uluzo lwawo Idizuwa dyo Kuhumula, elo niyo wambasa mlavyantambiko Yehoyada. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Mlavyantambiko niyo awenka awo amasekulu maguha na nchinga vyendaga vya seuta Daudi, izo zendaga zikwa mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />wamizi awo wendaga wachilmala kukongela ntendele ya kwamwemzi kubula ntendele ya chenya ye inyumba na kuzunguluka imazabahuyo kulaviza ntambiko ne inyumba chani wamzunguluke seuta, chila mntu katoza idiguha dyakwe mo mkono. <verse eid="2KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Akaheza niyo amlavya kuse Yoashi mwana ywa seuta, amvika chilemba komtwi na kumwinka useuta, wamhaka mavuta na kumtenda seuta, watowa magasa wagamba, “Seuta ekale mazuwa yalozize!” <verse eid="2KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Ataliya eze eve amaizwi ya awamizi hamwenga na wantu watuhu, niyo awabasa wadya awantu wendile wechisanya kwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Eze asungile niyo amwona seuta mhya kachimala haguhi ne inguzo kwe inchili ye Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, saviya vyendile mazwela, kuno masekulu na watowa magunda wakatenda haguhi na seuta, wantu wose nendile wakasendemka na kutowa magunda, aho niyo atatula izisuche zakwe alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Uno nubanasi! Uno nubanasi!” <verse eid="2KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Akaheza mlavyantambiko Yehoyada kwaviya haungile Ataliya akomelwe mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, niyo awalagiza masekulu wa awagomba nkondo awagamba, “Mlavyeni kuse Ataliya hagatigati ha awagomba nkondo, chila mntu akunga amtimile mkomeni.” <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Elo, niyo wamgwila, wamgwiza kwe inchili ye izifalasi kuhinga kweinyumba ye ichiseuta, niyo wamkomela uko.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyada ahitukila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 23:16-21">2Mihilimo 23:16-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Vikaheza Yehoyada niyo adamanya lagano na Zumbe Chohile na seuta na wantu kugamba nawatende wantu wa Zumbe Chohile, iviya niyo adamanya lagano mgati mwa seuta na awantu. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Vikaheza wantu wose wa Izulaeli wendile aho, niyo waita kwe inyumba yo kumvikila Baali waibogozola, watula imazabahuyo kulaviza ntambiko na amatukulu yakwe, wamkoma Matani mlavyantambiko ywa Baali kulongozi kweimazabahuyokulaviza ntambiko. Mlavyantambiko Yehoyada niyo aika wamizi chani wamile inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Vikaheza niyo awaguha masekulu wa wagomba nkondo, Wamizi wa hajihi wa seuta na awekazi wose, wamsindikiza seuta kulawa kwenyumba ya Zumbe Chohile wajinkila kweinchili ya awamizi kubula kwe imba yechiseuta. Seuta niyo ekala mwe ichigoda cho useuta kulagisa kugamba nuyo seunta mhya. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Ivyo, awekazi wose niyo wamema mbwedo Ataliya eze akomwe umo mwe idizumba dye ichiseuta, umzi wose niyo watondowala. <verse eid="2KI 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Yoashi akongaga kulongoza mweisi ya Yuda akatenda na mihilimo mfungate.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Yoashi ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 24:1-16">2Mihilimo 24:1-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Mo mhilimo wa mfungate wo uolongozi wa seuta Yehu ywa Izulaeli Yoashi akongaga kulongoza Yuda, uyo kalongoza kwa mihilimo milongo mine uko Yelusalemu. Nine endaga aketangwa Sibiya kulawa komzi wa Biasheba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Mo wikazi wakwe wose kadamanya mbuli zedi zimuwagile Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya mlavyantambiko Yehoyada nendile akamhinya. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Hata ivyo, ahantu henukile ho kuvikila milungu hahabalange, wantu nawakajendeleza kuvika na kuvunkiza ubani uko. <verse eid="2KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Yoashi niyo awetanga walavyantambiko awalagiza kugamba, “Hela zose zikwigalwa mweinyumba ya Zumbe Chohile hegu ilawana na vintu vikukile vitagigwe, hela ya chila mntu saviya awandikilwe na hela mntu akulavya kwa kunga mwenye mweinyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />walavyantambiko wazihokele kulawa kwa chila mntu, awo wadidamanye uhya Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile hantu hohose hakunga kudamanywa uhya.” <verse eid="2KI 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Mna hata mihilimo milongo midi na mitatu yo ulongozi wa seuta Yoashi walavyantambiko nendile hawadamanye uhya wowose mweinyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Ivyo, seuta Yoashi niyo amwitanga mlavyantambiko Yehoyada na walavyantambiko watuhu awauza, “Ni mbwani hamkuidamanya uhya Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile? Elo, msekuguha hela kulawa kwa awantu mkulongoza, mna nigailani chani Idihekalu didamanywe uhya.” <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Walavyantambiko niyo wazumila kugamba hawahokele hela vituhu kulawa kwa wantu, iviya niyo welisa kugamba hawaidamanye uhya Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Yehoyada niyo aguha shanduku aponkola langa mweingubiko yakwe, akaheza adika kwe imazabahu yo kulaviza ntambiko ntendele ya kulume uneva mntu akengila mwe Idihekaluu dya Zumbe Chohile. Awo walavyantambiko wendile mo uluzo kwe inchili waika izihela zose zigalwe mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Chila wakawona kugamba mwe idishanduku mna hela zilozize, yudya akuwandika izimbuli za seuta na mlavyantambiko mkulu nawengila na kuziwaza wakaheza wazinyinya mwe bahasha izihela zose zichisanywe mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Weze waheze kuziwaza niyo wawenka awandima wachimaile Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, awo niyo wawaliha mafundi wa kusongola na wazesi awo wazengile uhya Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />iviya wazesi na watula mayuwe, wajeseza kugula mbawo na mayuwe yatuligwe chani wazenge uhya Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile na kuchintiza ivintu vyose navikaungwa mo kuzenga uhya Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Hela zigalwe kwenyumba yo kuvikila hazijesezwe kulihila kudamanywa mabilika ya mayuwe ya chumbu na mikasi ya kukantila ntambi za mishumaa na mabakuli na magunda hegu viya vituhu vyovyose vya zahabu hegu viya vya chumbu. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />Zose zijesezwa kuwaliha awandima wazijeseze kudamanya uhya Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />Awandima wachimaile indima ino wendaga wakanuni vitendese, ivyo hawaungigwe walonge ivyo wazijeseze izihela izo. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Hela zilavigwe kutenda malavyo ya mlema na malavyo ya kusa masa hazingizwe mweinyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, izo zendaga hela za walavyantambiko. <verse eid="2KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Chipindi icho Hazaeli seuta ywa Alamu awebungaga umzi wa Gati niyo autaha. Mna Hazaeli eze ahinge komzi wa Yelusalemu chani akawebunge, <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />elo, seuta Yoashi ywa Yuda aguhaga amalavyo yose yakukizwe ni wababa zakwe maseuta wa Yuda, Yehoshefati na Yeholamu na Ahaziya nakongezeza na ziya izakwe, hamwenga ne izahabu yose yendile mwe ihazina ye Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile na kwe inyumba ye ichiseuta azigala kwa seuta Hazaeli ywa Alamu. Hazaeli niyo akulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye seuta Yoashi ziwandikwa mwechitabu cha Mbuli za Mihilimo za amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Masekulu wa awagomba nkondo wa Yoashi niyo wamdila njama, wamkomela mweinyumba ya Milo kweisila ikuhinga kweseleza ya Sila. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Wamkomile ni Yozakali mwana ywa Shimeati na Yehozabadi mwana ywa Shomeli wandima wakwe. Yoashi kahambwa kwe izimbila ze ichiseuta za wababa zakwe komzi wa Daudi. Amaziya mwana ywa Yoashi niyo atenda seuta ywa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Yehoazi ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Mo mhilimo wa milongo midi na mitatu yo ulongozi wa seuta Yoashi ywa Yuda, Yehoahazi mwana ywa Yehu akongaga kulongoza Izulaeli, kajendeleza kulongoza uko Samaliya kwa mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mfungate. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Akolaga masa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile saviya seuta Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebeti awahosizize awantu wa Izulaeli wakole masa. Yehoazi halekile kudamanya ntendwa zakwe zihiye. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile niyo awafila maya awantu wa Izulaeli, chila nkanana kawatenda wahundwe kwenkondo ni seuta Hazaeli ywa Alamu na mwanawe Beni Hadadi. <verse eid="2KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Yehoazi niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile, Zumbe Chohile eze awone ivyo seuta ywa Alamu awabunyanye awantu wa Izulaeli niyo eva amalombezo yakwe. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awenka chilongozi awantu wa Izulaeli uyo awakombole kulawa kwa Waalamu, elo niyo wekala kwa utondowazi saviya wekala aho nkongo. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Hata ivyo hawalekile kudamanya mbuli za masa izo seuta Yeloboamu awahosize awantu wa Izulaeli, wajendeleza kudamanya mbuli zawo za ukola masa ne iditukulu dya mnungu ywa chivyele Ashela dikigwa uko Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Yehoazi nendile hana wagomba nkondo walozize, mna endaga na wakwela falasi milongo mishano na wagomba nkondo wakujenda lwaviga elufu mlongo umwenga, kwaviya seuta ywa Alamu awakomaga awagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli na kuwasiliginta hasi ni wamema sanga nkundu. <verse eid="2KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Yehoazi na ukankalu wakwe yawandikwa mwechitabu cha Mbuli za Lukumbusa cha amaseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Yehoazi abanikaga na kuhambwa uko Samaliya, mwanawe akwitangwa Yehoashi niyo atenda seuta.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoashi seuta ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Mo mhilimo wa milongo mitatu na mfungate yo ulongozi wa seuta Yoashi ywa Yuda, Yehoashi mwana ywa Yehoazi akongaga kulongoza Izulaeli, kalongoza Samaliya na ulongozi wakwe wikala kwa mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mtandatu. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Yehoashi adamanyaga mbuli za masa kwa Zumbe Chohile, katimila mbuli saziya adamanye seuta Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebati awahosize awantu wa Izulaeli wakole masa. <verse eid="2KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Mbuli ntuhu zose za Yehoashi na ukankalu wakwe, nkondo agombile na seuta Amaziya ywa Yuda viwandikwa mweichitabu cha Mbuli za Lukumbusa cha amaseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Yehoashi abanikaga na kuhambwa kwezimbila wahambigwe maseuta watuhu uko Samaliya, Yeloboamu ywa kaidi niyo atenda seuta.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Muoni Elisha ahumaga unyonje wihise. Umo ehaguhi na kubanika, seuta Yehoashi ywa Izulaeli niyo amtalamkila. Eze ambwile Elisha niyo aila agamba, “Hoo tate, hoo tate! Mkankalu ywa Izulaeli!” <verse eid="2KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Elisha niyo amgamba, “Hake nigaila uta na mifulo!” Yehoashi niyo amwigaila. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Elisha niyo amgamba emalanye chani alase. Seuta niyo emalanya Elisha niyo aika imikono yakwe mlanga mwe imikono ya seuta. <verse eid="2KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Seuta katimila amalagizo ya muwoni niyo avugula ididilisha dikusinya ntendele ya Alamu. Elisha niyo amlagiza, “Kunta mfulo!” Ahadya seuta eze akunte umfulo, muwoni niyo agamba, “Weye nuwo umfulo wa Zumbe Chohile, kwa uwo nopate uhuda mwa awagomba nkondo wa Alamu. Nogombe nkondo na Waalamu uko komzi wa Afeka kubula uwahude.” <verse eid="2KI 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Akaheza Elisha niyo amgamba seuta aguhe imifulo imituhu aitowe hasi. Seuta niyo atowa mifulo hasi nkanana ntatu, akaheza niyo aleka. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Elisha niyo ehiwa vitendese, amgamba seuta, “Ni mbwani hutoile nkanana shano hegu mtantatu? Ivyo nakuwakoma pele awagomba nkondo wa Alamu. Mna haluse nowahude nkanana ntatu du.” <verse eid="2KI 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Elisha niyo abanika na kuhambwa. Chila mhilimo mabunga ya wantu kulawa Moabu yeza kuyebunga isi ya awantu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Zuwa dimwenga Waizulaeli nendile wakahamba mntu kwezimbila, wantu awo wakuhamba niyo wawona bunga dya wadya wakwizaga kuwebunga, wadya wenule ichimba niyo wachidula mwe imbila ya Elisha wasumka. Ahadya ichimba icho chize chikufye amafuha ya Elisha, niyo auyuka na kuchimala.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondo ya Waizulaeli na Waalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Seuta Hazaeli ywa Alamu nendile akawazila vitendese wantu wa Izulaeli chipindi chose cho ulongozi wa Yehoazi, <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />mna Zumbe Chohile kawalekeila amasa yawo na kuwafila mbazi. Kawasinya kwa wedi kwachausa cha lagano dyakwe na Bulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. Hawakomile naho hawajaile kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="2KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Hazaeli seuta ywa Alamu eze abanike, mwanawe akwitangwa Beni Hadadi niyo atenda seuta hantu haise. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Seuta Yehoashi kamhuda Beni Hadadi nkanana ntatu vyaleka aikombola imizi yose yendile itahwa mwe ichipindi cho ulongozi wa Yehoazi ise dya Yehoashi.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Amaziya seuta ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Mo mhilomo wa kaidi wo ulongozi wa Yehoashi mwana ywa Yehoahazi uko Izulaeli, Amaziya mwana ywa Yoashi seuta ywa Yuda akongaga kulongoza. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Umo akakonga kulongoza endaga na mihilimo milongo midi na mishano, alongozaga uko Yelusalemu kwa mihilimo milongo midi na chenda. Nine endaga aketangwa Yehoadani kulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Adamanyaga mbuli zikumuwagila Zumbe Chohile, mna hendaga saviya babakwe Daudi. Adamanyaga mbuli zose saviya ise Yoashi adamanye. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Uyo habalange ahantu hokuvikila milungu uko kwamagulu, wantu wajendeleza kuvika na kuvunkiza ubani uko. <verse eid="2KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Ahadya Amaziya eze edindimaze mo ulongozi, niyo awakoma wadya awandima wamkomile seuta Yoashi, kugamba ise. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Mna wana wa wadya awakomi wamkomile ise hawakomile, kwaviya viwandikwa mweichitabu che Isigilizi ya Musa, Chohile agamba, “Welesi hawakomwe kwa chausa cha masa yadamanywe ni wana wawo, hegu wana hawakomwe kwachausa cha masa yadamanywe ni welesi wawo, mna chila mntu nakomwe kwachausa cha masa adamanye mwenye.” <verse eid="2KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Amaziya kakoma wagomba nkondo wa Waedomu wakubula elufu mlongo umwenga Kwedibwandasi dyo Umunyu, niyo autaha umzi wa Sela niyo awitanga Yokiteli, ivyo nivyo ukwitangwa kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="2KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Vikaheza Amaziya niyo egala walosi kwa Yehoashi mwana ywa Yehoahazi, mwana ywa Yehu seuta ywa Izulaeli, amgamba, “So kuno chigombe nkondo.” <verse eid="2KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Mna Yoashi seuta ywa Izulaeli niyo amwigaila ulosi Amaziya seuta ywa Izulaeli amgamba, “Zuwa dimwenga mti wa miwa wa Lebanoni waugambaga mwelezi wa uko Lebanoni, ‘Mloze mchiche ywako kwa mwanangu.’ Mna kala dya kumbago niyo dyajinka dyaujata jata uwo umti we imiwa. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Haluse weye Amaziya kuwahuda Waedomu, umoyo wako wakutenda weduvye. Unanavyo vyachinta, ni mbwani ukwelondela nkunto nazikukome weye mwenye hamwenga na awantu wako wa Yuda?” <verse eid="2KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Mna Amaziya niyo ahufya ulosi uwo. Ivyo Yehoashi seuta ywa Izulaeli niyo aita na awagomba nkondo wakwe wakugomba nkondo na Amaziya uko Beti Shemeshi kweisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Wagomba nkondo wa Yuda niyo wahudwa ni wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli, chila yumwenga niyo auya kwekaya yakwe. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Yehoashi seuta ywa Izulaeli niyo amtaha Amaziya seuta ywa Yuda uko Beti Shemeshi, niyo aita komzi wa Yelusalemu abogozola ichiwambaza chakwe kukongele kwenchili ya Efulaimu kubula kwempembe ya inchili, utali wakwe mita magana maidi. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Kaguha izahabu yose ne ichumbu, iviya kaguha ne ivimpandwa vyose vyendile mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile na idya yendile mwe ihazina ye idizumba dye chiseuta, iviya kataha wantu niyo auya Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Yehoashi na ukankalu wakwe, nkondo agombile na seuta Amaziya ywa Yuda viwandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Yehoashi eze abanike niyo ahambwa mwe izimbila wahambigwe amaseuta awatuhu uko Samaliya. Yeloboamu ywa kaidi niyo atenda seuta hantu hakwe.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Amaziya seuta ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 25:25-28">2Mihilimo 25:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Seuta Amaziya ywa Yuda ekalaga mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mishano seuta Yehoashi ywa Izulaeli eze abanike. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Amaziya ziwandikwa mwe Ichitabu cha Mbuli za Mihilimo za Amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Njama za kumkoma Amaziya zadamanyagwa uko Yelusalemu, ivyo niyo asumkila Lakishi, mna awankondo wakwe wegala wantu niyo wakumkomela uko. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Ichimba chakwe niyo chakwezwa mlanga mwe falasi chegalwa Yelusalemu chakuhambwa mwe izimbila wahambigwe maseuta awatuhu uko komzi wa Daudi. <verse eid="2KI 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Vikaheza awantu wose wa Yuda niyo wamguha Uziya akatenda na mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mtandatu wamtenda seuta hantu haise Amaziya. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Ize iheze ifile ya ise, Uziya niyo auzenga uhya umzi wa Elati na kuwavuziza awantu wa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Yeloboamu ywa kaidi ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Mo mhilimo wa mlongo umwenga na mishano wo ulongozi wa Amaziya mwana ywa Yoashi seuta ywa Yuda, Yeloboamu mwana ywa Yehoashi seuta ywa Izulaeli akongaga kulongoza uko Samaliya, kalongoza kwa mihilimo milongo mine na mhilimo umwenga. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Kadamanya mbuli za ukola masa kwa Zumbe Chohile, katimila mbuli saziya adamanyaga seuta Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebeti awahosize awantu wa Izulaeli wakole masa. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Akombolaga isi yose yendile ya Izulaeli, kulawa Hamati kubula kwe Bahali ya Alaba. Ivyo nivyo alongaga Zumbe Chohile kujinkila umndima ywakwe Yona mwana ywa Amitai muwoni kulawa Gati Hefeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />Ivyo vilaila kwaviya Zumbe Chohile awonaga izinkunto zikulise wapatile awantu wa Izulaeli, hakwendaga na mntu yoyose ywa kuwambiza. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Mna Zumbe Chohile nendile halongile kugamba nawabinde pele awantu wa Izulaeli, ivyo awakombolaga kujinkila kwa seuta Yeloboamu mwana ywa Yohoashi. <verse eid="2KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Yeloboamu na nkondo agombile kwa ukankalu na viya aikombole Damesiki na Hamati itenda ya Izulaeli, vyose viwandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Yeloboamu abanikaga na kuhambwa kweizimbila wahambigwe amaseuta awatuhu wa Izulaeli, mwanawe akwitangwa Zekaliya niyo atenda seuta hantu hakwe.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Uziya ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 26:1-23">2Mihilimo 26:1-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Mo mhilimo wa milongo midi na mfungate wo ulongozi wa Yeloboamu seuta ywa Izulaeli, Azaliya mwana ywa Uziya akongaga kulongoza akatenda seuta uko Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Umo akakonga kulongoza endaga na mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mtandatu. Kalongoza uko Yelusalemu kwa mihilimo milongo mishano na midi. Nine naketangwa Yekoliya kulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Adamanya mbuli zikumuwagila Zumbe Chohile saziya zose adamanye ise. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Mna ahantu hokuvikila kulanga kwa amagulu hahabalangwe, wantu wajendeleza kuvika na kuvunkiza ubani uko. <verse eid="2KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amjelaga unyonje wa matana Uziya kubula aho abanikile. Ekalaga mwe nyumba ye ichedu, ndima zose zo ulongozi nendile zikadamanywa ni mwanawe Yotamu. <verse eid="2KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Mbuli zose ntuhu adamanye Uziya ziwandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Uziya eze abanike niyo ahambwa kweizimbila wahambigwe amaseuta awatuhu komzi wa Daudi, mwanawe akwitangwa Yotamu niyo atenda seuta hantu ha ise.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Zekaliya ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Mo mhilimo wa milongo mitatu na mnane yo ulongozi wa Uziya seuta ywa Yuda, Zekaliya mwana ywa Yeloboamu akongaga kulongoza Izulaeli, kalongoza kwa myezi mtandatu iyodu akatenda ekala komzi wa Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Uyo naye adamanyaga yehiye saviya wadamanyaga amaseuta wamlongoile, kamleka Zumbe Chohile. Katimila mliganyo wihiye wa seuta Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebeti awahosize awantu wa Izulaeli wakole masa. <verse eid="2KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Shalumu mwana ywa Yabeshi niyo adya njama mwa seuta Zekaliya, kamtowa na kumkoma kulongozi kwa wantu, niyo atenda seuta hantu hakwe. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Zekaliya ziwandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa amaseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Izimbuli izo zilaila saviya Zumbe Chohile alongaga kwa seuta Yehu akagamba, “Welekwa wako nawalongoze Izulaeli kubula cheleko cha kane.”<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Shalumu ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Mo mhilimo wa milongo mitatu na chenda yo ulongozi wa seuta Uziya ywa Yuda, Shalumu mwana ywa Yabeshi akongaga kulongoza Izulaeli, alongozaga kwa mwezi umwenga du akatenda ekala komzi wa Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Manahemu mwana ywa Gadi akulawaga komzi wa Tiliza aita Samaliya, uko niyo amkoma Shalumu mwana ywa Yabeshi, akaheza Manahemu niyo atenda seuta, eze amkome Shalumu. <verse eid="2KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Mbuli ntuhu zose za Shalumu ne izinjama zakwe zose adamanye ziwandikwe mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Akatenda emwesila akalaila komzi wa Tiliza Manahemu niyo aubalanga vitendese umzi wa Tapua, kakoma awekazi wakwe hamwenga na awekazi we isi yose iuzunguluke kwaviya walemelaga kunga utondowazi mwakwe. Iviya wavyele wendile wasoka awatumbulaga wose.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Manahemu ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Mo mhilmo wa milongo mitatu na chenda yo ulongozi wa seuta Uziya ywa Yuda, Menahemu mwana ywa Gadi akongaga kulongoza Izulaeli, kalongoza uko Samaliya kwa mihilimo mlongo umwenga. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Mazuwa yose yo ulongozi wakwe kadamanya mbuli zimwihize Zumbe Chohile, halekile kudamanya mbuli zihiye saziya adamanye Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebeti awahosize awantu wa Izulaeli wakole masa. <verse eid="2KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Elo, Pulu seuta ywa Ashulu niyo ayebunga isi ya Izulaeli, Manahemu niyo amwinka chilo milongo mitatu na nne za chumbu chani amwambize kudindimaza ulongozi wakwe mweisi ya Izulaeli, <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Manahemu apataga izihela izo kwa kuwakunkusa awagoli wa Izulaeli chila yumwenga alavye nchango ya shekeli milongo mishano ya hela. Ivyo, Pulu hekale Izulaeli mna auyaga kweisi yakwe. <verse eid="2KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Menahemu ziwandikwa mwechitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menahemu niyo abanika, mwanawe akwitangwa Pekahiya niyo atenda seuta ise eze abanike.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Pekahiya ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Momhilimo wa milongo mishano yo ulongozi wa seuta Uziya ywa Yuda, Pekahiya mwana ywa Menahemu akongaga kulongoza Izulaeli, alongozaga kwa mihilimo midi akatenda ekala uko Samaliya.<verse eid="2KI 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Kadamanya mbuli zilozize za ukola masa kwa Zumbe, katimila mbuli zihiye saziya zidamanywe ni seuta Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebeti awahosize awantu wa Izulaeli wakole masa. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Sekulu ywa awagomba nkondo wa Pekahiya akwitanga Peka mwana ywa Lemaliya, ambizanaga na wantu watuhu milongo mishano kulawa Giliyadi wamkoma Pekahiya mwe ingome ya mndani ye idizumba dye chiseuta uko Samaliya, Peka niyo atenda seuta hantu ha Pekahiya. <verse eid="2KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Pekahiya ziwandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Peka ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Mo mhilimo wa milongo mishano na midi yo ulongozi wa seuta Uziya ywa Yuda, Peka mwana ywa Lemaiya akongaga kulongoza akatenda ekala uko Samaliya, kalongoza kwa mihilimo milongo midi. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Iviya uyo niyo adamanya mbuli za ukola masa kwa Zumbe Chohile, katimila mbuli zihiye saziya zidamanywe ni seuta Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebeti ahosize awantu wa Izulaeli wadamanye mbuli za ukola masa. <verse eid="2KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Chipindi cho ulongozi wa Peka seuta ywa Izulaeli, seuta Tigilati seuta ywa Ashulu atahaga imizi ya Iyoni na Abeli Beta Maka na Yanoa na Kadeshi na Hazoli hamwenga ne isi ya Giliyadi na Galilaya na Nafutali niyo ataha awekazi we imizi iyo. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Mo mhilimo wa milongo midi yo ulongozi wa Yotamu mwana ywa Uziya seuta ywa Yuda, Hoshea mwana ywa Ela amfungilaga njama Peka mwana ywa Lemila, kamkoma akaheza niyo alongoza hantu ha Peka. <verse eid="2KI 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Peka ziwandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Yotamu ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 27:1-9">2Mihilimo 27:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Mo mhilimo wa kaidi wo ulongozi wa Peka mwana ywa Lemila uko Izulaeli, Yotamu mwana ywa seuta Uziya seuta ywa Yuda akongaga kulongoza uko Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />Umo akakonga kulongoza endaga na mihilimo milongo midi na mishano, kalongoza uko Yelusalumu kwa mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mtandatatu. Nine etangangwa Yelusha mchiche ywa Sadoki.<verse eid="2KI 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Kadamanya mbuli zedi zimuwagile Zumbe Chohile saviya adamanyaga ise Uziya. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Mna, ahantu hokuvikila milungu ya udanti hahabalange, wantu wajendeleza kulavya malavyo na kuvunkiza ubani ahantu aho. Yotamu niyo azenga inchili ya ntendele ya chenya ye Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Mbuli zose ntuhu adamanye Yotamu ziwandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />Mo ulongozi wakwe Yotamu, Zumbe Chohile akongaga kuwatuma seuta Lesini ywa Alamu na seuta Peka ywa Izulaeli chani wakayebunge Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Yotamu niyo abanika na kuhambwa kwe izimbila ze ichiseuta wahambigwe amaseuta watuhu uko komzi wa Daudi. Mwanawe akwitagwa Ahazi niyo atenda seuta ize eze abanike.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Ahazi ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Mo mhilimo wa mlongo na mfungate wo ulongozi wa Peka mwana ywa Lemaliya seuta ywa Izulaeli, Ahaziya mwana ywa Yotamu niyo akonga kulongoza uko Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahazi umo akakonga kulongoza endaga na mihilimo milongo midi. Kalongoza uko Yelusalemu kwa mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mtandatu. Hadamanye mbuli zikuwagila kwa Zumbe Chohile saviya Daudi babakwe adamanye, <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />katimila lujendo lwihiye lwa amaseuta wa Izulaeli. Iviya kamlavya mwanawe ntambiko kwa kumjisa mwe moto, katimila mazwela yehiye ya wantu wa si ntuhu, awo wabalazwe ni Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli umo wendaga wakengila mwe isi. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Ahazi kalavya malavyo na kuvunkiza ubani hantu henukile, kwawagulu na hasi he chila mti mbisi. <verse eid="2KI 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Vikaheza seuta Lesini ywa Alamu na Peka mwana ywa Lemaliya seuta ywa Izulaeli wafosa chani wagombe nkondo na awantu wa Yelusalemu, wamtandama Ahazi mna hawadahile kumhuda. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Mwe ichipindi icho, seuta ywa Alamu autahaga na kuwavuziza awantu wa Alamu umzi wa Elati, kawabalaza awantu wa Yuda wendaga wakekala umo momzi. Wantu wa Alamu niyo wengila momzi wa Elati waika wikazi wawo kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="2KI 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Ivyo, Ahaziya niyo atuma walosi kwa seuta Tigilati Pileseli ywa Ashulu wakatenda na ulosi uno, “Miye mndima ywako mkanuni. So unambule kwa maseuta wa Alamu na Izulaeli awo wakunebunga.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Ahaziya niyo aguha chumbu na zahabu mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile ne ihazina yendaga mwe inyumba ya seuta na kumwigaila seuta ywa Ashulu saviya majeleko. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Tigilati Pileseli niyo azumila kudamanya viya Ahaziya alombeze, kawebunga umzi wa Damesiki na kuutaha. Kataha awantu womzi wa Damesiki na kuwegala kwemzi ukwitangwa Kili, akaheza niyo amkoma seuta Lesini. <verse eid="2KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Vikaheza seuta Ahaziya niyo aita komzi wa Damesiki akadugane na seuta Tigilati Pileseli, uko awonaga mazabahu ya kulaviza ntambiko. Elo, niyo amtumila umdolonyo we imazabahu iyo mlavyantambiko Uliya, hamwenga no umwalo wase wo uzesi ivyo ukungwa ujeswe. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Ivyo, Uliya kazenga iyo imazabahu kuligana na ivyo umdolonyo wili, kabinda kuizenga umo Ahaziya henati kuya kaya. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Ahaziya eze auye kulawa Damesiki, niyo awona iyo imazabahu, kaisogeila na kulavya malavyo mlanga mwakwe. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Kalavya malavyo yakwe ya kutikimya na mpuluzi na yakunywa, niyo amyaga sakame ya malavyo ya utondowazi. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Mazabahu idamanywe kwa shaba ya kulaviza ntambiko ikigwe ukuka kwa Zumbe Chohile kayusa kulongozi kwe inyumba kulawa ahantu yaikigwe hagati he imazabahu yakwe ne inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, niyo aika hantu hendile ntendele ya chenya ye imazabahu yakwe. <verse eid="2KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Niyo amlagiza Uliya amgamba, “Jeseza ino imazabahu yangu nkulu kwa kutikimiza malavyo ya mtondo na malavyo ya mpuluzi ya nechisingi, malavyo ya kutikimya na malavyo ya mpuluzi ya seuta na awantu wose, iviya na malavyo ya divai ya wantu. Imyagile sakame ya awanyama wose wo kutikimya awo walavigwe malavyo. Mna idya imazabahu idamanywe kwa shaba miye naniijeseze kumuza ulangilizi Chohile.” <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Mlavyantambiko Uliya niyo ajesa saviya alagizwe ni seuta. <verse eid="2KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Seuta Ahazi niyo ausa izifulemu zendile zichimaliswa uko, niyo ausa ibilika ikwitangwa bahali iyo yendile mlanga mwe ziya izinjeku mlongo na mbili zidamanywe kwa saba na kuika mlanga mwe chegamo cha mayuwe. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Ne idiheha nadikasejezwa mwe Idizuwa dyo Kuhumula dyendile dizengwa mndani mwe inyumba hamwenga ne ibalaza ya kuse, seuta kavisamiza kulawa mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile kwachausa cha seuta ywa Alamu. <verse eid="2KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye seuta Ahazi ziwandikwa mwechitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ahazi niyo abanika na kuhambwa kwe izimbila wahambigwe amaseuta awatuhu komzi wa Daudi, mwana ywa Ahazi akwitangwa Hezekiya niyo atenda seuta ise eze abanike.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Hoshea ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Mo mhilimo wa mlongo na mbili wo ulongozi wa seuta Ahazi ywa Yuda, Hoshea mwana ywa Ela akongaga kulongoza Izulaeli, kalongoza kwa mihilimo chenda akatenda ekala uko Samaliya. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Kadamanya mbuli za ukola masa kwa Zumbe Chohile, mna masa akoile sayo sayadya yadamanywe na amaseuta wa Izulaeli wamlongoile. <verse eid="2KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Seuta Shalimanesa ywa Ashulu amwebungaga, Hoshea niyo atenda mndima ywake amliha kodi chila mhilimo. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Mna chipindi chimwenga Hoshea asigilaga walosi kwa seuta Soo ywa Misili alombeza wambizi, aho niyo aleka kuliha kwa seuta Shalimanesa ywa Ashulu saviya azwele kudamanya chila mhilimo. Shalimanesa eze awone ivyo niyo amtaliza minyolo Hoshea na kumjela mwechifungo.<verse eid="2KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhudwa kwa Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Seuta ywa Ashulu niyo ayebunga isi yose ya Izulaeli aubwila umzi wa Samaliya autanadama kwa mihilimo mitatu. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Mo mhilimo wa chenda wo ulongozi wa Hoshea, seuta ywa Ashulu niyo awataha awantu wo umzi wa Samaliya, kawataha awantu wa Izulaeli na kuwegala Ashulu, awamwenga kawaika ko mkowa ukwitangwa Hala Gozani wi hajihi na umto wa Haboli, na awatuhu kawaika komzi wa Mediya. <verse eid="2KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Yose ayo yadamanyika kwaviya wantu wa Izulaeli wamleka Zumbe Chohile ywawo, uyo awalavize mwemikono ya seuta ywa Misili, iviya wavikila milungu mituhu, <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />na kutimila sila za wantu wa izisi ntuhu wabalazwe ni Zumbe Chohile kulongozi kwa Waizulaeli, na kudamanya mbuli zingizwe mwe isi ni maseuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Wantu wa Izulaeli wadamanya kwa chinyele mbuli zihiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo. Wazenga hantu henukile hakuvikila milungu ya udanti mwe chila mzi, kukongela kwe imizi imidodo kubula kwe mizi mikulu. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Kulanga kwe chila kagulu na chila hantu hana mti una mani mabisi, wazenga nguzo za mayuwe na matukulu ya mnungu ywa chivyele akwitangwa Ashela, <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />niyo wavunkiza ubani kwe izimazabahu zose zo kulaviza ntambiko za milungu yo udanti kutimila mazwela ya wantu wa izisi ntuhu awo wabalazwe ni Zumbe Chohile, wamwihiza Zumbe Chohile kwa ntendwa zawo zihiye, <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />naho wasankanila matukulu ayo Zumbe Chohile awalemeze akagamba, “Msekudamanya izimbuli izo.” <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />Zumbe Chohile niyo atuma wawoni na walotezi chani wawafunde awantu wa Izulaeli na Yuda, akagamba, “Lekani izisila zenyu zihiye mtimile imiko yangu na malagizo yangu kutimilana na izisigilizi niwenkile wababa zenyu, naho izo siwenkani kujinkila kwa awandima wangu wawoni.” <verse eid="2KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Mna wowo hawanitegeleze, wendaga wankani saviya wababa zawo, awo hewemzumile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Walemela kutimila malagizo yakwe, hawatozize lagano adamanye na wababa zawo, hamwenga na kuhufya amakanyo yakwe, wavikila matukulu kubula wowo wenye hawana mana, watimila mazwela ya wantu watuhu wawazunguluke, wahufya imiko ya Zumbe Chohile naho hawaitimile. <verse eid="2KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Wabalanga imiko yose ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, niyo wadamanya matukulu ya milungu ya wadama waidi wa kusana, iviya niyo wadamanya matukulu ya mnungu ywa chivyele akwitangwa Ashela niyo wavikila ivintu vyose vya mo ulanga na kumsankanila mnungu Baali. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Wawalavya ntambiko wana wawo wa chilume na wachiche kwa milungu yaudanti, waunga ulangilizi kwa walotezi na wasai. Wekamba vitendese kudamanya mbuli zihiye kwa Zumbe Chohile, wamwihiza vitendese. <verse eid="2KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo aweihiwa vitendese wantu wa Izulaeli niyo awabalaza chani asekuwawona, hasigaze mntu, ukaleka awantu we idikabila dya Yuda awodu. <verse eid="2KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Mna hata awantu we idikabila dya Yuda hawatimile imiko ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, watimila mazwela yegalwe ni wantu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Zumbe Chohile kawalemela Waizulaeli na Wayuda wose, kawakantila na kuwaleka mwe imikono ya wankondo wawo wakali, akaheza niyo awabalaza chani asekuwawona. <verse eid="2KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />Zumbe Chohile eze awasente wantu wa Izulaeli kulawa mo ulukolo lwa Daudi, niyo wamwika Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebeti atende seuta. Uyo Yeloboamu niyo awahosa awantu wa Izulaeli wamleke Zumbe Chohile wadamanya mbuli zikuile za ukola masa. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Waizulaeli wadamanya mbuli za masa zidamanywe ni Yeloboamu, wadunduga kuzileka, <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />izimbuli izo zihosa Zumbe Chohile awabalaze kulongozi kwakwe, saviya alongaga kujinkila kwa awandima wakwe wose wawoni. Ivyo wantu wa Izulaeli niyo watahigwa kulawa mweisi yawo wenye wegalwe kweisi ya Ashulu uko wakwikala kubula vino haluse.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Ashulu waika wikazi wawo Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Vikaheza seuta ywa Ashulu niyo aguha wantu kulawa Babeli na Kuta na Ava na Hamata na Sefalivaimu awaika komzi wa Samaliya hantu hawantu wa Izulaeli wasamizwe. Niyo waguha iyo imizi na kwikala umo. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Niyo vyalaila kugamba weze wakonge kwikala umo, hawamvikile Zumbe Chohile, ivyo Zumbe Chohile niyo atuma simba, izo zikoma awamwe wawo. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Wantu niyo wamgambila seuta ywa Ashulu, “Wantu we izisi usamize na kuwaika mwe imizi ya Samaliya hawamanyize izimbuli akunga mnungu ywa iyo isi, ivyo uyo mnungu katuma simba zikuwakoma.” <verse eid="2KI 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Aho, seuta ywa Ashulu niyo alagiza vino, “Guhani mlavyantambiko yumwenga mwa wadya mtahile kulawa Samaliya chani auye ekale uko na kuwahinya mbuli ziya akunga mnungu ywa isi iyo.” <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Ivyo mlavyantambiko yumwenga atahagwa kulawa Samaliya niyo aita akwikala komzi wa Beteli kuwahinya wantu ivyo vikuwagila kumvikila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Mna izisi zose mwe imizi wekale wedamanyiza milungu yawo na kuika hantu henukile uko wantu wa Samaliya nendile wadamanye. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Wantu walaile Babeli niyo wadamanya mnungu ywawo akwitangwa Sukoti Beneti na wantu walaile Kuta niyo wadamanya mnungu ywawo akwitangwa Neligali na wantu walaile Hamati wadamanya mnungu ywawo akwitangwa Ashima. <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />Waavi wadamanya Nibuhazi na Talitaki, Wasefelivaimu walavya wana wawo watende malavyo ya kutikimya kwe imilungu yawo ya Adulameleki na Anameleki. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Wantu awo iviya wamvikila Zumbe Chohile. Mna iviya wasagulaga wantu wawo wasiku chani wawajeseze mwembuli zawo za ulavyantambiko hantu hokuvikila milungu hantu henukile he imiviko ye imilungu kwachausa chawo. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Wamvikila Zumbe Chohile mna iviya wasankanila milungu yawo waguhile kweizisi walaile. <verse eid="2KI 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Kubula vino dyelo wajendeleza kutoza mbuli zawo za chikale wazwele. Hawakumvikila Zumbe Chohile viya vikungwa naho hawakutimila izinkanto na amalagizo, miko na sigilizi ziya Zumbe Chohile awenkile awelekwa wa Yakobo, yudya amwinkile zina hya dya Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />Umo Zumbe Chohile akadamanya Lagano na Waizulaeli kawalagiza kugamba, “Msekuvikila milungu yoyose mituhu naho msekuifikila madi hegu kuisankanila hegu kuilaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Mna mwaungwa mnivikile miye Zumbe Chohile, miye niwalavizeni kweisi ya Misili kwa nguvu na udahi wangu mkulu. Kwangu miye namfike madi na kunilaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Mazuwa yose mwaungwa mkaulise kutimila izinkanto na amalagizo, miko na sigilizi niwagambileni. Msekuvikila milungu mituhu mpwii. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Msekujala lagano nidamanye na nyuwe, naho msekuvikila milungu mituhu. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />Mna, namnivikile miye Zumbe Chohile ywenyu, miye nuyo naniwakomboleni kulawa mwa awankondo wenyu wose.” <verse eid="2KI 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Hata ivyo hawevile, mna wajendeleza kudamanya mbuli zawo wazwele kudamanya. <verse eid="2KI 17:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Hata umo awantu awo wakamvikile Zumbe Chohile, wendile wachei wakasankanila matukulu yawo. Kubula vino dyelo welekwa wawo wajendeleza kudamanya mbuli saziya wadamanye watati zawo.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Hezekiya ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Mo mhilimo wa katatu wo ulongozi wa Hoshea mwana ywa Ela akatenda seuta ywa Izulaeli, Hezekiya mwana ywa Ahaziya seuta ywa Yuda akongaga kulongoza. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Hezekiya umo akakonga kulongoza endaga na mihilimo milongo midi na mishano. Alongozaga uko Yelusalemu kwa mihilimo milongo midi na chenda. Nine nendile aketangwa Abiya, mchiche ywa Zekaliya. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Hezekiya adamanyaga mbuli zedi zikumuwagila Zumbe Chohile saziya adamanye babakwe Daudi. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />Abalangaga ahantu hose henukile hakuvikila milungu ya udanti na kutula izinguzo za amayuwe zo kuvikila za mnungu Ashela. Iviya atulaga tukulu dya nyoka ya shaba dyadamanyagwa ni Musa nadiketangwa Nehushitani, kwaviya kubula amazuwa ayo wantu wa Izulaeli wendaga wachei wadivunkiziza ubani iditukulu idyo. <verse eid="2KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hezekiya aikaga msuhi wakwe kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, mgati mwa amaseuta wose wa Yuda wamlongoile na wamtimile hahana endile sauyo. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Uyo kamwetegeleza Zumbe kwa kuhikiliza naho halekile kumtimila, katoza imiko yose Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa kwachausa cha awantu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Zumbe Chohile niyo atenda hamwenga naye niyo achumilwa mwe chila mbuli adamanye. Iviya alemelaga kumtimila na kumsankanila seuta ywa Ashulu. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Awatowaga Wafilisiti kubula komzi wa Gaza neisi iwazunguluke kukongele komnala wa awamizi kubula komzi uzengelwe ngome. <verse eid="2KI 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Mhilimo wa kane wo ulongozi wa Hezekiya, iviya wendaga mhilimo wa mfungate wo ulongozi wa Hoshea mwana ywa Ela seuta ywa Izulaeli, seuta Shelimanesa ywa Ashulu awebungaga umzi wa Samaliya na kuutandama kwa wagomba nkondo. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Mo udumo wa mhilimo wa katatu wagomba nkondo wa Ashulu wautahaga umzi wa Samalia. Uwo wendaga mhilimo wa mtandatu wo ulongozi wa Hezekiya iviya ni mhilimo wa chenda wo ulongozi wa Hoshea seuta ywa Izulaeli umo awantu wo umzi wa Samaliya wakatahwa. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Seuta ywa Ashulu awatahaga awantu wa Izulaeli na kuwegala Ashulu, awamwenga awaikaga komzi wa Hala, awatuhu hajihi no umto wa Haboli komzi wa Gozani, awatuhu kawaika kwemizi ya Waamedi. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Ayo yalaila kwaviya wantu wa Izulaeli hawatimile viya alongile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, mna waleka idilagano dyakwe, naho hawatimile yadya yose walagizwe ni Musa mndima ywa Chohile.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Senakelibu ywa Ashulu awawatisa awantu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2Mihilimo 32:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Isaya 36:1-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Mo mhilimo wa mlongo na mine yo ulongozi wa seuta Hezekiya, seuta Senakelibu ywa Ashulu ayebungaga imizi yose ya Yuda yazengelagwa ngome niyo aitaha. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Hezekiya niyo atuma ulosi uko Lakishi kwa Senakelibu amgamba, “Sibalanga. Hampu leka kunebunga miye nahulihe chochose naunge.” Seuta ywa Ashulu niyo amlagiza Hezekiya amwigaila tani mlongo umwenga za chumbu na tani imwenga ya zahabu. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Hezekiya niyo amwigaila ichumbu chose chendile mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile na mwe ihazina ye idizumba dya seuta. <verse eid="2KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Iviya Hezekiya niyo abandula izahabu yose imamatizwe mwe izinyivi ze Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile na idya izahabu amamatize mwenye mwe izifulemu ze izinyivi, yose niyo amwigaila Senakelibu. <verse eid="2KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Vikaheza, Seuta ywa Ashulu niyo amsigila sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo wakwe na sekulu ywakwe mkulu na chilongozi mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wakwe hamwenga na wagomba nkondo walozize kulawa Lakishi kwita Yelusalemu kwa seuta Hezekiya. Watamba niyo wabula Yelusalemu. Weze wabule niyo wengila na kuchimala hampezo ho mfilimbi ukwigala mazi kwe idibwawa dintendele ya kuchenya mwe isila nkulu ikuhinga kwe ichiwasa cha awantu wakufuila suche. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Niyo wamwitange seuta Hezekiya, niyo wasingilwa ni Eliyakimu mwana ywa Hilikiya, endaga mta kuchimaila idizumba dya seuta na Shebuna mta kuwandika na Yao mwana ywa Asafu mta kuwandika Mbuli zijinkile za mihilimo za seuta. <verse eid="2KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Yudya sekulu ywa awagomba nkondo wa Ashulu niyo awagamba, mgambileni Hezekiya, Vino nivyo seuta mkulu, seuta ywa Ashulu akulonga, “Msuhi wako kuwika kwa yuhi? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Togola wafanyanya kugamba ulosi uwodu wadaha ukuhuda mwe nkondo? Msuhi wako kwika kwa yuhi vikuleka wanihituka? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Kaula, haluse kwika msuhi kweisi ya Misili ikwambize ni saviya tete kuditenda nkome ya kutalamkila difyokile idyo mntu anadyegamila dyamlumiza. Ivyo nivyo eli Falao seuta ywa Misili kwa mntu yoyose namwikiye msuhi.” <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />“Weye unanigamba, ‘Msuhi wetu chawika kwa Zumbe Chohile ywetu’, Mmanye kugamba ni Chohile uyo uyo, yudya Hezekiya abogozole ahantu hakwe henukile ne izimazabahu zakwe, nakuwagamba awantu wa Yuda na Yelusalemu wavike du kulongozi kwe imazabahu iyuko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />Haluse damanyani wivano na sekulu ywangu seuta ywa Ashulu, miye naniwenkeni falasi elufu mbili, uneva namdahe kupata wakwela falasi. <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Weye ne idyo idibunga ididodo dya wagomba nkondo, nodahe vivihi kumvuza kunyuma sekulu yumwenga wa bunga dodo naho dihwele dya wagomba nkondo dya sekulu ywangu, kuno mwaika msuhi kweisi ya Misili iwegaileni malingisha na wakwela falasi?” <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Kujinka ivyo, mwafanyanya kugamba siza hehena sigilizi ya Zumbe Chohile chani niyebunge na kuibalanga ino isi? Zumbe Chohile nuyo anigambile, “Yebunge ino isi na kuibalanga.” <verse eid="2KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Elo, Eliakimu mwana ywa Hilikiya na Shebuna na Yoa wamgamba uyo sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa Ashulu, “Hampu losana na suwe kwa longa dya Chialamu kwaviya chadiva vyedi, usekulosana na suwe kwa Chiebulania kwaviya wantu wemwe chiwambaza wetegeleza.” <verse eid="2KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Mna yudya sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo niyo awagamba, “Togolani sekulu ywangu kanisigila nilavye ulosi uno kwa sekulu ywenyu na kwenyu du? Togolani iviya hanisigile kwa wantu wakwikala mweviwambaza wakantilwe hamwenga na nyuwe kudya amavi yawo na kunywa amakozo yawo wenye?” <verse eid="2KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Vikaheza yudya sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo niyo achimala alonga Chiebulania kwa izwi kulu, “Tegelezani milosi ya seuta mkulu, seuta ywa Ashulu akuwagambilani! <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Vino nivyo akulonga seuta, Msekuzumila kudantwa ni Hezekiya, kwaviya hadahe kuwambulani. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Msekuzumila awaluvyeni chani mwike msuhi kwa Zumbe Chohile akagamba, Zumbe Chohile nachambule naho uno umzi haujelwe mwemikono ya seuta ywa Ashulu. <verse eid="2KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Msekumwetegeleza Hezekiya, mwetegelezeni seuta ywa Ashulu agamba, ‘londani utondowazi na miye, naho mwize kwangu. Aho chila yumwenga ywenyu nadahe kudya ntunda za mzabibu wakwe mwenye, ntunda za mtini wakwe mwenye na kunywa mazi yakulawa mwesima dyakwe mwenye, <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />kubula aho nyumani nanizile na kuwegalani hale kweisi saino iyenyu, si ina nkande na divai, si ina nkonde za ngano na nkonde ya mizabibu, si ina mizaituni na uchi. Uneva mnazumila vino hulonga hambanike mna namtende na ujima.’ Msekumwetegeleza Hezekiya akawadanta akagamba, Zumbe Chohile nachambule. <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Togolani, hana mnungu ywa si yoyose ambule isi yakwe kulawa mwemikono ya seuta ywa Ashulu? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Togolani, ikuhi imilungu ya Hamati na Alipadi. Ikuhi imilungu ya Sefalivaimu na Hena na Iva, Togolani iwambula Samaliya kulawa mwemikono yangu? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Ni mnungu yuhi mgati mwe zino izisi ambule isi yakwe mwangu vileke ufanyanye Zumbe Chohile nadahe kuwambula umzi wa Yelusalemu kulawa mwangu? <verse eid="2KI 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Mna wantu wose niyo wanyamala dwii, hawahitule ulosi wowose saviya walagizwe ni seuta Hezekiya, akagamba, msekumhitula.” <verse eid="2KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Vikaheza, Eliakimu mwana ywa Hilikiya mta kuchimaila inyumba ya seuta na Shebina mta kuwandika na Yoa mwana ywa Asafu mta kuwandika Mbuli za Mihilimo niyo wambasa seuta Hezekiya kuno watatula izisuche zawo, wamgambila mbuli zose wagambilwe ni yudya sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Seuta alombeza wambizi kwa Isaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Seuta Hezekiya eze eve izimbuli izo, niyo atatula izisuche zakwe avala majuniya engila kwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Kawalagiza Eliakimu sekulu ywe idizumba dya seuta na Shebuna mta kuwandika na wadalahala wa walavantambiko, wambase muwoni Isaya mwana ywa Amozi, wakatenda wavala majuniya. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Awo niyo wamgamba Isaya, “Hezekiya agamba vino, dyelo ni zuwa dya chiholozi, zuwa dya kukwahilwa na kubelwa. Suwe chitenda saviya msoka akunga kwefungula, mna hakudaha kwefungula. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Vyadahika Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako nakeva ulosi wa sekulu ywa wakulu wa wagomba nkondo, uyo asigilwe ni seuta ywa Ashulu sekulu ywakwe, chani amhulute Chohile mta ujima, uyo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, nakwahile mbuli evile. Elo, walombezeze wantu wasigale.” <verse eid="2KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Ivyo, wandima awo wa seuta Hezekiya weze wabule kwa Isaya, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />kawetegeleza niyo awagamba, “Mgambileni sekulu ywenyu, vino nivyo Zumbe Chohile akulonga, ‘Usekogoha kwachausa cha mbuli wivile, izo wandima wa seuta ywa Ashulu awalongile kunitila. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Tegeleza! Nanitende seuta eve mbuli siku, nauye kweisi yakwe, uko nanihose akomwe kwa mabamba.’”<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta ywa Ashulu awatisa vituhu Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 37:8-20">Isaya 37:8-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Vikaheza yudya mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo eze eve kugamba seuta ywa Ashulu kakulawa Lakishi kambasa na kumbwila kawebunga umzi wa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Vikaheza seuta eze eve ulosi kugamba Tilihaka seuta ywa Kushi eza kugomba nkondo naye, niyo asigila walosi kwa Hezekiya, kugamba, <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Mgambileni Hezekiya seuta ywa Yuda, ‘Usekuzumila kudantwa nuyo Chohile ywako ukwikiya msuhi akagamba umzi wa Yelusalemu hautahigwe ni seuta ywa Ashulu. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Kwa ukanuni kwiva ivyo maseuta wa Ashulu ivyo wazitendile izisi ntuhu na kuzibalanga vitendese. Togola weye wafanyanya nohone? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Togola, milungu ye izisi izo yambulaga Gozani na Halani na Lesefu na Waedeni wekalaga Telasali, izisi izo wababa wazibalangaga? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Wekuhi amaseuta wa Hamati na Alipadi na Sefavaimu na Hena na Iva?’”<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya Hezekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Seuta Hezekiya kahokela baluwa kulawa kwa walosi niyo aisoma. Akaheza niyo aita akwingila kwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, niyo aifungula kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Akaheza niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile akagamba, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, ukwikala mwe ichigoda chako cho uzumbe mlanga mwe vyumbe vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi, ni weye Chohile ichedu, ukulongoza seuta zose za mweizisi. Weye kumba isi na ulanga. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, gubula ameso uwone, tega gutwi dyako wive amahuluto yose Senakelebu akukuhuluta weye Zumbe Chohile mta ujima.” <verse eid="2KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />“Weye Zumbe Chohile, ni chindedi kugamba maseuta wa Ashulu wabalanga wantu ne izisi zawo. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />Awo wadulaga milungu yawo mo moto kwaviya hayendile milungu ya chindedi, mna yendaga matukulu ya miti na mayuwe du yasongolwe ni mikono ya wantu. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Haluse, weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, nakweila chambule kulawa mwe imikono yakwe, chani maseuta wose mweisi wamanye kugamba weye ichedu ni weye Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Isaya kwa seuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 37:21-38">Isaya 37:21-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Vikaheza Isaya mwana ywa Amozi niyo asigila ulosi kwa Hezekiya, akamgamba, “Vino nivyo akulonga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, ‘Siyeva amalombezo yako kumlanga Senakelebu seuta ywa Ashulu.’” <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Uno nuwo ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile alongile ukumlanga Senakelebu, “Akuhufya na kukubela weye mchiche ywa Sayuni, asingisa mtwi wakwe kunyuma kwako mchiche ywa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />Togola, uyo ukutila na kumhuluta ni yuhi? Wamgutila yuhi na kumng'oila meso kobezi, kunidamanyiza miye Mkuka ywa Izulaeli!” <verse eid="2KI 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />Kwa kuwasigila walosi wako kumtila Zumbe Chohile, weye kugamba, “Kwa malingisha yangu ya nkondo yalozize, sikwela vinenengwe vya magulu, kubula ko lunenengwe lwa Lebanoni. Mielezi yakwe mitali siisenga, ne imisonobali imitana, singila kubula mndani mwakwe na mndani mwe izimbago zakwe nkulu. <verse eid="2KI 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Sisimba masima mwe izisi ze chijeni na kunywa amazi yakwe. Kwa lwayo lwe iviga vyangu sinyaza imito yose za Misili.” <verse eid="2KI 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />“Togola hwivile, chikale vidala silagiza imbuli ino.” Chino hudamanya sichifanyanya mazuwa. Kugamba uzenge mizi ina ngome kwa visungu vya makalankala. <verse eid="2KI 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Wantu wakwe wakatenda wasilwa ni nguvu, wogoha na kufa chevu naho wajelwa soni. Watenda saviya mani ya kwenkonde, saviya mani yanyuluke. Saviya mani yakuhota kulanga kowala yakunyala heyenati kukula. <verse eid="2KI 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />“Mna miye simanya chila chintu chako, ukengila na ukafosa, ne ivyo ukuniihiwa sivimanya. <verse eid="2KI 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Kwaviya wanifila maya naho ubezi wako siwiva, nanike indwana yangu mwe impula yako, na kazuma kakuwogweila mo mlomo wako. Nahuvuze mwesila idya wizile.” <verse eid="2KI 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Vikaheza Isaya amgamba Hezekiya, “Chino nachitende chilagiso kwako, mhilimo uno na ukwiza namdye chehotele. Mna mhilimo wa katatu namhande na kulozola, namhande zabibu na kudya izintunda zakwe. <verse eid="2KI 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Wantu wo ulukolo lwa Yuda wasigale nawajenyele na kutenda walozize saviya mti ukuhoteza maizi yakwe mwesanga na kweleka ntunda kulanga. <verse eid="2KI 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Kwaviya nakutenda na wantu nawasigale uko Yelusalemu, heye uko kolugulu lwa Sayuni nakutende na wantu nawasigale, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kekamba kudamanya izimbuli izo. Kwekamba kwa Zumbe mta nguvu zose nuwo nauchintize ayo.” <verse eid="2KI 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />“Ivyo Zumbe Chohile agamba vino kumlanga seuta ywa Ashulu, ‘Hengile muno mo mzi hegu kulasa mfulo hegu kuubasa kwa nchingo hegu kuutandama. <verse eid="2KI 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Nauye kwa sila idya ezile naho hengile muno mo mzi.’ Ivyo nivyo akulonga Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />‘Mzi uno naniudime na kuwambula kwa chausa cha ntunyo yangu na kwachausa che idilagano nimwikiye mndima ywangu Daudi.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Ichilo icho mlosi ywa Zumbe Chohile niyo engila mwe inkambi ya Waashulu na kukoma wantu laki imwenga na milongo mnane na shano elufu. Kwize kuche wantu niyo wenuka, wawona vimba vya wantu chila hantu. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Ivyo, vikaheza Senakelebu seuta ywa Ashulu niyo ahalawa aita akwikala kweisi ya Ninawi <verse eid="2KI 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Zuwa dimwenga Senakelebu umo akavika mwe inyumba ya Nisiloki mnungu ywakwe, wanawe waidi, Adulameleki na Sheleza niyo wamkoma kwa bamba, niyo wasumkila kweisi ya Alalati. Mwanawe akwitangwa Esali Hadoni niyo atenda seuta ise eze abanike.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Hezekiya ahuma na kuhona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Amazuwa ayo, Hezekiya ahumisaga hadodo abanike, Muoni Isaya mwana ywa Amozi niyo ambasa amgamba, “Vino nivyo Zumbe Chohile akulonga, ‘Damanya vyedi mbuli ze inyumba yako kwaviya nobanike hohone.’” <verse eid="2KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Hezekiya niyo ahitukila kwenkandula amlombeza Zumbe Chohle agamba, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />“Weye Zumbe Chohile kumbuka viya husankanile kwa moyo wose na ivyo nidamanye yakuwagila kulongozi kwako.” Hezekiya niyo aila kwa usungu utendese. <verse eid="2KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Umo Isaya henati kujinka uwa wa hagati, ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamwizila, kugamba, <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />“Uya ukamgambe Hezekiya, mkulu ywa awantu wangu. Miye Zumbe Chohile ywa mkale ywako Daudi, siva idilombezo dyako naho mesozi yako siyawona elo nahuhonye. Nahuhonye mazuwa matatu yanomboka nawite kwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Nahongeze mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mishano ya ujima. Nahwambule weye hamwenga na uno umzi kulawa mwe imikono ya seuta ywa Ashulu. Mzi uno naniudime kwachausa cha ntunyo yangu na kwachausa cha lagano nimwikiye mndima ywangu Daudi.” <verse eid="2KI 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Vikaheza, Isaya niyo agamba, “Nigailani nkuyu inyaile muimamatize mwe idihu dyakwe chani ahone.” <verse eid="2KI 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Hezekiya niyo amuza Isaya, “Ni chilagiso chani icho nachinilagise kugamba chindedi Zumbe Chohile nanihonye na zuwa dya katatu nanidahe kwita kwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile?” <verse eid="2KI 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Isaya amhitula, “Chino nachitende chilagiso kwako kulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile kugamba, Zumbe Chohile nadamanye saviya alongile. Togola wonga ichizuli che idizuwa chime izintantillo chite nkacho mlongo kulongozi hegu chuye kunyuma nkacho mlongo?” <verse eid="2KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Hezekiya ahitula, “Nivihufu chizuli kwita kulongozi nkacho mlongo! Leka chuye kunyuma nkacho mlongo.” <verse eid="2KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Isaya niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile, Zumbe Chohile niyo atenda ichizuli chuye nkacho mlongo kulawa heizintantilo zidamanywe ni Ahazi.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi kulawa kwa seuta ywa Babeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">Isaya 39:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Mwa amazuwa ayo seuta Melodaki Baladani, mwana ywa Baladani seuta ywa Babeli nakeva kugamba Hezekiya kahumisa mna haluse kahona, niyo amwigaila ulosi na majeleko. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Hezekiya niyo awahokela na kuwalagisa ugoli wakwe. Nyumba yakwe ye ihazina, hela na zahabu na vilungo vya kwambikila, mavuta ya kupwepweleka ne inyumba ye iviziha vyakwe vyose vya kugombela nkondo na vintu vyose vyendile mwe izihazina zakwe. Hakwendila na chochose mwe inyumba yakwe hegu kweisi yakwe hewalagise. <verse eid="2KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Aho muwoni Isaya niyo ambasa Hezekiya amuza, “Wano wantu wagamba mbwani? Naho wakubasa walawa kuhi?” Hezekiya amhitula, “Wanibasa walawa si ya hale uko Babeli.” <verse eid="2KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Niyo amuza, “Wawona mbwani mwe idizumba dyako?” Hezekiya amhitula, “Wawona vyose vimwe idizumba dyangu. Hahana chochose mwa amagulu yangu siwalagise.” <verse eid="2KI 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Aho, Isaya amgamba Hezekiya, “Tegeleza ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />Kaula, mazuwa yeza vintu vyose vimwe inyumba yako vichisanywe ni watati zako kubula mazuwa yano navigalwe kubula Babeli. Hahana chintu chochose nachisigale, nivyo Zumbe Chohile akulonga. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />Naho wanawo wasiku wa chilume nawatahwe, awo nawafuntwe na kutendwa wandima mwe idizumba dya seuta ywa Babeli.” <verse eid="2KI 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Hezekiya niyo amgamba Isaya, “Ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile saviya ulongile uchuma.” Kalonga ivyo kwaviya nakafanyanya, “Ni mbwani visekutenda ivyo hegu nakutende na utondowazi mo ulongozi wangu.”<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhelo wo ulongozi wa Hezekiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 32:32-33">2Mihilimo 32:32-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Mbuli ntuhu adamanye Hezekiya na ukankalu wakwe na milosi ya ivyo azengile idibwawa na kusimba mfilimbi ukwigala mazi komzi, yawandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa maseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Hezekiya niyo abanika, mwanawe akwitangwa Manase niyo atenda seuta ise eze abanike.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Manase ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 33:1-20">2Mihilimo 33:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manase endaga na mihilimo mlongo umwenga na midi umo akakonga kulongoza Yuda, kalongoza kulawa Yelusalemu kwa mihilimo milongo mishano na mishano. Nine naketangwa Hefisiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Manase kadamanya mbuli za wavu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa kutimila lujendo lwihiye lwa wantu we izisi wabalazwe ni Zumbe Chohile umo awantu wakwe wa Izulaeli umo wendaga wakengila mweisi iyo. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Kwaviya ahazengaga uhya ahantu henukile ho kuvikila milungu mituhu habalangwe ni ise Hezekiya, niyo azenga mazabahu ya kulaviza ntambiko za kumvikila mnungu Baali na kudamanya tukulu dya Ashela, saviya adamanye Ahabu seuta ywa Izulaeli. Iviya kafikila madi na kuvikila vintu vyose vya kulanga. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />Niyo azenga mazabahu za kuvikila milungu mndani mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, hantu aho Zumbe Chohile alongaga, “Awantu wo umzi wa Yelusalemu nawanivikile miye.” <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Mwe izinyuwa mbili ze Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile azengaga mazabahu ya kuvikila vintu vya mo ulanga. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Iviya kamlavya mwanawe lavyo dya kutikimya. Kasinya mlamulo, kahima ndege akambizana na walaguzi wa wazimu na wasai. Kadamanya wavu utendese kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile niyo amjela maya vitendese. <verse eid="2KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Niyo aguha iditukula dya Ashela adamanye adika mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile amgambaga Daudi na mwanawe Solomoni vino, “Mwe Idihekalu dino na momzi wa Yelusalemu nisagule naho ahantu nanivikilwe kale na kale. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Naho hegu Waizulaeli wanatimila na kudamanya mbuli zose nilagize na kutimila imiko yangu yose wenkigwe ni Musa mndima ywangu, saniwaleke wabalazwe kulawa mweisi ino niwenkile watati zawo.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Mna hawanivile, uyo Manase kawahosa wakolese masa kujinka yadya yadamanywe na awantu we izisi ntuhu awo Zumbe Chohile awabalangaga kulongozi kwa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="2KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Aho, Zumbe Chohile niyo alonga kujinkila awandima wakwe wawoni akagamba, <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />“Manase seuta ywa Yuda kadamanya mbuli zikwihiza, mbuli zihiye vitendese kujinka ziya zidamanywe ni Waamoli wamlongwele, iviya kawahosa awantu wa Yuda nawo wakole masa kwa kujeseza amatukulu yakwe. <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />Elo haluse miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, nanigale file zilozize mwa Yelusalemu na Yuda, yoyose akunga eve imbuli iyo netuke. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Yelusalemu naniukantile saviya niukantile Samaliya na seuta Ahabu hamwenga na welekwa wakwe. Yelusalemu naniuse saviya mntu akusa sahani isuntigwe na kuigubika. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Naniwase awantu wangu nawasigale naniwenkize kwa wankondo wawo chani wawahude, na kutaha isi yawo. <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />Naniwadamanyize ayo yose kwaviya wakola masa kulongozi kwangu na kunijela maya kukongela wadalahala wawo walaile Misili kubula vino dyelo.” <verse eid="2KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Vikaheza ivyo, ukaleka amasa yakwe awahosize awantu wa Yuda wakole masa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, iviya Manase kakoma wantu walozize hewene masa, sakame yamemaga kulawa ntendele imwenga kubula ntendele ntuhu ya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Ntendwa ntuhu zidamanywe ni Manase hamwenga na amasa yakwe yose ziwandikwa mwechitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Manase kabanika na kuhambwa mwechibuta chimweidizumba dyakwe dye chiseuta chidamanywe ni Uza. Ivyo mwana ywa Manase akwitangwa Amoni niyo atenda seuta.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Amoni ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 33:21-25">2Mihilimo 33:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amoni endaga na mihilimo milongo midi na midi umo akakonga kulongoza. Kalongoza uko Yelusalemu kwa mihilimo midi. Zina dya nine naketangwa Meshulemeti mchiche ywa Haluzi kulawa komzi wa Yotiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Amoni kadamanya mbuli za wavu kulongozi kwa Chohile, saviya adamanye ise Manase. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Katimila lujendo lose lwa ise kavikila matukulu ayadya ise avikile na kuyafikila madi. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />Kalemela kutimila izisila za Zumbe Chohile ywa wakale wakwe, hatozize imiko ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Nyumani awandima wakwe niyo wadya njama wamkomela mwe idizumba dyakwe dye chiseuta. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Mna wantu wa Yuda niyo wawakoma awantu wose wamkomile Amoni. Vikaheza wantu awo niyo wamsagula Yosiya mwana ywa Manase atende seuta. <verse eid="2KI 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Amoni ziwandikwa mwechitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Amoni kahambwa mwe izimbila mwe ichibuta cha Uza, vikaheza mwanawe akwitangwa Yosiya niyo atenda seuta ise eze abanike.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Yosiya ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:1-2">2Mihilimo 34:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Seuta Yosiya endaga na mihilimo mnane umo akakonga kulongoza uko Yelusalemu, niyo alongoza kwa mihilimo milongo mitatu na umwenga. Nine naketangwa Yedida mchiche ywa Adaya, mwikazi ywo umzi wa Bosikati. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Yosiya kadamanya mbuli zedi zimwelele Zumbe Chohile. Katongela mligano wa seuta Daudi amlongwele na kutoza imiko ya Zumbe Chohile kwa kukaulisa.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitabu cha sigilizi chabunkulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:8-28">2Mihilimo 34:8-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Mo mhilimo wa mlongo na mnane wo ulongozi wakwe, seuta amsigilaga mta kuwandika mbuli zakwe, Shafani mwana ywa Azaliya, mwezukulu ywa Meshulamu, aite kwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile, akamgamba, <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />“Hita kwa mlavyantambiko mkulu Hilikiya mgambe awaze ziya izihela zigalwe mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile izo zichisanywe ni wata kuchimaila kulawa kwa awantu. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Wagambile wazinkize izihela izo kwa awantu wasagulwe kuchimaila indima ye Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile. Walagize awantu awo wawalihe awandima wakuzenga uhya Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />kugamba wakusongola na wazesi na wambizi wawo. Naho wagambile wagule mbao na mayuwe yasongolwe kwa ndima ya kuzenga uhya inyumba. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Wantu wakuchimaila uzesi wasekutigizwa walavye uwazwa wajeseze izihela nawenkigwe, kwaviya wazijeseza kwa ukanuni.” <verse eid="2KI 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Vikaheza mlavyantambiko mkulu Hilikiya niyo amgamba Shafani mta kuwandika, “Sichipata Ichitabu che Izisigilizi mwe Idihekalu dya Zumbe Chohile.” Hilikiya niyo amwinka Shafani icho ichitabu, uyo niyo achisoma. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Shafani mta kuwandika niyo ambasa seuta akumgambila ulosi uwo, amgamba, “Wandima wako walavya izihela zilondolwe mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile naho wazinkiza kwa awazesi wakuchimaila kuzenga uhya Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Vikaheza Shafani mta kuwandika amgamba seuta, “Hilikiya mlavyantambiko kaninka chitabu.” Shafani niyo achisoma kulongozi kwa seuta. <verse eid="2KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Seuta eze eve ulosi uwandikwe mwechitabu che Isigilizi niyo atatula izisuche zakwe, <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />seuta niyo awalagiza, Hilikiya mlavyantambiko na Ahikamu mwana ywa Shafani na Akiboli mwana ywa Mikaya na Shefani mta kuwandika na Asaya mndima ywa seuta awagamba, <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />“Hitani mkamuze Zumbe Chohile ulangilizi kwachausa changu na kwachausa cha awantu wose wa Yuda mwembuli ziya ziwandikwe mndani mwechitabu chino chiwoneke. Zumbe Chohile anase kuchiwonela maya suwe, kwaviya watati zetu hawatimile imilosi ye ichitabu chino, hawadamanye kuligana na mbuli zose ziya ziwandikwe umo zikuchilanga suwe.” <verse eid="2KI 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Ivyo, mlavyantambiko Hilikiya na Ahikamu na Akiboli na Shafani na Asaya waita wakulosana na muwoni mvyele akwitangwa Huluda, uyo endaga mkaza Shalumu, mwenawe dya Tikwa, mwezukulu ywa Halihasi mta kutunduliya izisuche ze Inyumba ya Chohile. Ichipindi icho, Huluda nendile akekala komzi wa Yelusalemu mwe ikaya ya kaidi. <verse eid="2KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Niyo amgamba, “Vino nivyo akulonga Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli, mgambile uyo mtu awatumileni kwangu, <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, nanigale nkomano ahantu hano na kwawekazi wakwe saviya viwandikwe mwechitabu chino chisomigwe ni seuta ywa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Kwaviya wanileka naho wavunkiziza ubani milungu mituhu, ivyo wanisonga maya kwa ndima zose ze imikono yawo, amaya yangu nayemuke mwa awantu wa Yelusalemu naho hahana nadahe kuyachinda. <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Mna kumlanga seuta ywa Yuda awatumileni mwize muze ulangilizi kwa Zumbe Chohile, vino nivyo Zumbe, Chohile ywa Izulaeli akulonga mwembuli wivile. <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />Kwaviya kwiva viya nilongile kulanga ahantu hano, kugamba awekazi wakwe nawaligitwe na kwasigwa wachiwa, niyo weila na kunyanyahala kulongozi kwangu na kutatula izisuche zako elo, miye nami sikwiva chiya ulombeze, <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />ivyo nkomano hunga nigale mwa awekazi wa Yelusalemu hoziwone, nanigoje unde kubanika uhambwe kwa utondowazi.” Walosi awo niyo wakumgambila seuta ulosi uwo.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s">Yosiya adamanya lagano uhya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 34:3-7">2Mihilimo 34:3-7</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 34:29-33">29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Vikaheza seuta Yosiya niyo egala wantu, wamchisanyiza vilongozi wose wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Niyo seuta aita kwe Inyumba ya kumvila Zumbe Chohile hamwenga na awantu wose wa Yuda na wekazi wose wa Yelusalemu walavyantambiko na hamwenga na wawoni, wantu wose wakulu na wadodo. Niyo awasomela ulosi we ichitabu che idilagano chibwilwe mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Vikaheza seuta niyo achimala hajihi ne inguzo aika ndagano kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, amtimile Zumbe Chohile, kutoza malagizo yakwe viya akunga mo moyo wakwe ne iloho yakwe yose kudamanya ulosi wakwe wose we idilagano yawandikwe mwe ichitabu icho, wantu wose niyo walungana mo kwika indagano.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Yosiya niyo amlagiza mlavyantambiko mkulu Hilikiya na walavyantambiko wambizi wakwe na wamizi wo lwivi walavye vintu vyose nendile vikigwe kwe Inyumba yo kumvikila ya Zumbe Chohile, vidamanywe kwa chausa cha mnungu Baali, na Ashela na kwa chausa cha vintu vya mo ulanga. Niyo avitikimya kuse komzi wa Yelusalemu kwe idikolongo dya Kiduloni na kuyaguha amaivu ayo na kuyegala kubula Beteli. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Niyo awausa walavyantambiko wose wasagulwe na maseuta wa Yuda kwa kuvunkiza ubani hantu ho kuvikila mwe mizi ya Yuda na kuzunguluka Yelusalemu. Naho wadya wose wavunkize ubani kwa Baali, zuwa na mnenge naho ntondo na ivintu vya moulanga mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Niyo ausa iditukulu dya Ashela kulawa kwe inyumba ya Zumbe kuse kwa Yelusalemu, niyo adigala kwa akamto ka Kiduloni. Uko niyo aditikimya dyatenda maivu, amaivu yakwe niyo ayafilisa mlanga mwe izimbila za wantu. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Niyo atula izinyumba za wagosi wachilanga zendile mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, hantu wavyele nawasuma mapaziya ya Ashela mnungu mvyele. <verse eid="2KI 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Niyo awachisanya walavyantambiko wose kulawa kwe mizi ya Yuda na kuwegala Yelusalemu. Niyo abalanga izimazabahu zo kuvunkiza ubani kulawa Geba kubula Balisheba. Niyo atula imazabahu yendile ntendele ya kumoso kolwivi lo mzi kwe izinyivi zendile zikwesila yo kwingilila kolwivi lwa Yoshuwa chilongozi ywo umzi. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Walavyantambiko awo hawalekelwe wasankane mwe ndima yo ulavyantambiko mwe imazabahu ya Zumbe Chohile uko Yelusalemu, mna wadya imikate heigwaduswe wenkigwe ni walukolo wawo walavyantambiko.<verse eid="2KI 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Seuta Yosiya niyo abalanga ahantu ha kuvikila milungu yo udanti hakwitangwa Tofesi kwedikolongo dya wana wa Hinomu, chani mntu yoyose asekumtikimya mwanawe ywa chilume hegu mchiche ywakwe atende ntambiko kwa mnungu Moleki. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Naho ausaga izifalasi izo zendile zikajesezwa ni maseuta wa Yuda mwe kuvikila mnungu zuwa, iviya katikiywa amalingisha na wakajesaza mwe imiviko iyo. Falasi izo na amalingisha ayo yaikagwa homwingilo we inchili ye Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, naho nendile ni hajihi ne ichumba nakekala Nasani Meleki yumwe mwe vilongozi wakulu. <verse eid="2KI 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Imazabahu yazengigwe ni maseuta wa Yuda mlanga mwe idihala dye ichumba cha kulanga cha Ahazi, hamwenga ne imazabahu izengigwe ni Manase mwe izinyuwa izimbili ze Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. Kayatula niyo ayatiginta, malumbi yakwe niyo ayadula kwa kamto ka Kiduloni. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Naho nakabalanga hantu hakuvikila ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wa Yelesalemu na ntendele yo ulugulu lwo ubanasi, hantu seuta Solomoni ywa Izulaeli azengile kwa chausa cha mnungu Asitaloti ihizo dya Wasidoni na Kemosi ihizo dya Wamoabu, naho kwa chausa cha Milikomu ihizo dya Waamoni. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Nguzo kazitula vihandehande, naho tukukulu dya Ashela niyo achikantakanta, hantu hachimaliswe amatukulu ayo niyo ahajela uzavu kwa kumemeza mavuha ya wantu.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Naho kudya Beteli niyo abalanga hantu hakuvikila hazengigwe ni seuta Yeloboamu mwana ywa Nebeti awahosaga awantu wa Izulaeli wakole masa. Imazabahu iyo kaibalanga, mayuwe yakwe niyo ayatulatula vihandehande, kavihondahonda vyatenda malumbi, iditukulu dya Ashela niyo aditikimya. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Vikaheza, Yosiya eze ahituke niyo awona mbila mlanga mwe kagulu. Niyo alagiza mavuha mwe izimbila izo yafukulwe, niyo ayatikimya mlanga mwe imazabahu. Kwa kudamanya ivyo aijelaga uzavu imazabahu isekuwagila kuvikila kuligana na ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile ulongigwe ni mtu ywakwe, muwoni alotelaga ivyo navilaile. <verse eid="2KI 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Niyo seuta auza, “Idya imbila huwona izengelwe kudya ni ya yuhi?” Wantu wo mzi uwo niyo wamhitula, “Ni mbila ya mntu ywa Zumbe Chohile ezaga kulawa kweisi ya Yuda niyo alotela yadya yose udamanye mwe imazabahu yo kulaviza intambiko uko Beteli.”<verse eid="2KI 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Seuta niyo alagiza. “Yaseni ivyo ili, mntu yoyose asekusa amavuha yakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:18">Ivyo, amavuha yakwe niyo wayasa ahadya, hamwenga na amavuha ya muwoni alawaga Samaliya.<verse eid="2KI 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Mwe chila mzi wa Samaliya seuta Yosiya niyo ahajela uzavu ahantu hokuvikila milungu ya udanti hazengigwe ni maseuta wa Izulaeli, ivyo vileka wamjele maya Zumbe Chohile. Izimazabahu zose izo kazibalanga saviya adamanye kudya Beteli. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Yosiya niyo awakomaga awalavyantambiko wose we imilungu yo udanti mlanga mwe izimazabahu zawo wenye, mavuha yawo niyo ayatikimya mlanga mwe izo izimazabahu. Akaheza niyo auya Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosiya adamanya lukumbusa lwa ngasu ya Pasaka ya kulawa Misili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 35:1-19">2Mihilimo 35:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Vikaheza seuta Yosiya niyo alagiza awantu wose, awagamba, “Damanyani ngasu ye Pasaka kwa kumtunya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu saviya viwandikwe mweichitabu chino chibunkulwe kwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Hahana Pasaka ivinigwe saviya ino kukongela ichipindi cha walamuzi wawalongoze Waizulaeli hegu ichipindi cha maseuta wa Izulaeli hegu wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Ivyo mo mhilimo wa mlongo na mnane wo ulongozi wa Yosiya, Pasaka yo kumtunya Zumbe Chohile ivinilwa uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ntuhu adamanye seuta Yosiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Naho, seuta Yosiya awausaga wasai na walotezi na milungu na matukulu ya milungu hamwenga na viya vituhu vijeseze kuvikila milungu ya udanti. Chani ajese izisigilizi zose ziwandikwe mweichitabu chibunkulwe ni mlavyantambiko mkulu Hilikiya kwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Umo Yosiya henati kutenda seuta na hata aho akomelezaga kutenda seuta hahalaiga seuta yoyose enga yeye, amsankanile Zumbe Chohile kwa moyo wakwe wose na nguvu zakwe zose na loho yakwe wose kuligana ne isigilizi ya Musa.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Mna Zumbe Chohile halekile ukali na maya yakwe yalozize kwa awantu wa Yuda kwaviya seuta Manase adamanyaga ntendwa zilozize zimjeile maya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Zumbe Chohile niyo agamba, “Naniwabalaze awantu wa Yuda kulawa kulongozi kwangu saviya nidamanye mwa awantu wa Izulaeli. ‘Naniulemele umzi wa Yelusalemu nasagule hadya nagambaga wantu nawanivikile miye momzi umo.’”<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udumo wo ulongozi wa seuta Yosiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 35:20-36:1">2Mihilimo 35:20-36:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Mbuli ntuhu zose adamanye Yosiya, ziwandikwa mweichitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Mo ulongozi wa Yosiya, seuta Neko ywa Misili nakaita kubula ko mto wa Fulati wakadugane na seuta ywa Ashulu. Mna seuta Yosiya niyo aita akatowane naye, seuta Neko ywa Misili eze amuwone seuta Yosiya niyo amkomela uko Megido. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Wandima wakwe wakulu niyo wenula ichimba chakwe mwe idilingisha wachivuza Yelusalemu uko niyo wamhamba mwe imbila yakwe mwenye. Wantu wa Yuda niyo wamguha Yohazi mwana ywa Yosiya, wamhaka mavuta wamwika atende seuta ise eze abanike.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Yohazi ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:2-4">2Mihilimo 36:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Yehoahazi endaga na mihilimo milongo midi na mitatu akakonga kulongoza, kalongoza chipindi cha myezi mitatu akatenda Yelusalemu. Nine naketangwa Hamutali mchiche ywa Yelemiya mwikazi ywo umzi wa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Yehoahazi niyo adamanya yehiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile saviya vyose wadamanye wababa zakwe. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Chani asekujendeleza kulongoza akatenda Yelusalemu, seuta Neko ywa Misili nendile kamfunga uko Libila kwe isi ya Hamati, niyo awalihiza kodi awantu wose wa Yuda chilo elufu ntatu na magana mane za mayuwe ya chumbu na chilo milongo mitatu na nne za zahabu. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Neko seuta ywa Misili niyo amwika Eliakimu mwana ywa seuta Yosiya atende seuta hantu ha ise Yosiya, Niyo ahituila idizina dyakwe amwitanga Yehoyakimu. Mna niyo amguha Yohazi amwigala hale kubula Misili niyo abanikila uko.<verse eid="2KI 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Yehoyakimu ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:5-8">2Mihilimo 36:5-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Yehoyakimu niyo amwinka mayuwe ya chumbu na zahabu seuta ywa Misili, awalihiza kodi awantu, chani ajese viya akunga seuta ywa Misili kwa kwinkwa hela. Kawalihiza hela na zahabu. Chila yumwenga nakalavya kuligana na ivyo seuta alagize, niyo amwinka Neko seuta ywa Misili.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Yehoyakimu kakonga kulongoza akatenda na mihilimo milongo midi na mishano, kalongoza chipindi cha mihilimo mlongo umwenga na umwenga akatenda Yelusalemu. Zina dya nine naketangwa Zebida mchiche ywa Pedaya mwikazi ywa mzi wa Luma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Yehoyakimu niyo adamanya yehiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile sayadya yose wadamanye wakale wakwe.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Mo useuta wa Yehoyakimu, Nebukadineza seuta ywa Babeli ayebunga isi ya Yuda. Yehoyakimu kakunduganywa atenda mndima ywa seuta Nebukadineza kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mitatu, vikaheza niyo aleka kumwetegeleza amhituka. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amwigaila mabunga ya manyakwili wa Wababeli na manyakwili wa Alamu na manyakwili wa Wamoabu na manyakwili wa Amoni wayebunge isi ya Yuda na kuibalanga, kuligana na ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile alongile kujinkila wandima wakwe wawoni. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Mbuli izo niyo zalaila mwe isi ya Yuda chindedi kwa lagizo dya Zumbe Chohile, chani awasamize kulongozi kwakwe kwa masa akoile seuta Manase na mbuli zose adamanye, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />naho seuta Manase kahosa wantu hewena lema wakomwe uko Yelusalemu. Masa ayo Zumbe hamlekeile.<verse eid="2KI 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Elo, ntendwa ntuhu na mbuli zose adamanye Yehoyakimu yawandikwa mwechitabu cho Lukumbusa lwa amaseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Yehoyakimu niyo abanika mwanawe akwitangwa Yehoyakini niyo alongoza ise eze abanike.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Seuta ywa Misili na awagomba nkondo wakwe hawafosize vituhu mwe isi yawo, kwaviya seuta ywa Babeli nakaziguha izisi zose nazikalongozwa ni seuta ywa Misili aho nkongo kukongela kwa kamto ka Misili kubula komto wa Efulati kaitende itende yakwe.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Yehoyakini ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">2Mihilimo 36:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Yehoyakini kakonga kulongoza akatenda na mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mnane. Kalongoza uko Yelusalemu kwa myezi mitatu. Nine naketangwa Nehusita, mchiche ywa Elinatani mwikazi ywa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Yehoyakini kadamanya yehiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile saviya adamanye ise.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Chipindi icho wagomba nkondo wa Nebukadineza seuta ywa Babeli, niyo wawebunga umzi wa Yelusalemu niyo wautandama. <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />Chipindi awankondo wa Nebukadineza wakautandama umzi, Nebukadineza mwenye niyo abula Yelusalemu, <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />Yehoyakini seuta ywa Yuda hamwenga na nine niyo wenula mikono na kwita wenye kwa seuta ywa Babeli, wandima wakwe, wakulu na vilongozi wa wagomba nkondo wakwe. Seuta ywa Babeli niyo awegala saviya watahigwe mo mhilimo wa mnane wo ukulongoza kwakwe. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Naho saviya Zumbe alongile, Nebukadineza niyo aguha ugoli wose nendile wimwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, na mnyumba mwe idizumba dye chiseuta. Niyo atulatula ivintu vyose vya zahabu vyadamanyagwa ni seuta Sulemani ywa Izulaeli. Viya ivyo nendile vimndani mwe inyumba yo kumvikila Zumbe. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Kawaguha awantu wose kulawa Yelusalemu na kuwegala ko usamizo, wakulu wose na wantu wose wendile wakankalu na wafungwa elufu mlongo umwenga na mafundi wose na wafuwa vyuma. Hahana asigale, wadya wendile wachiwa vitendese mwe isi nawo wasigale.<verse eid="2KI 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Kamwigala Yekoniya hamwenga na nine dya seuta kubula Babeli wavyele wa seuta, wakulu wa wagomba nkondo wakwe, na wakulu we isi wose. Awo kawalavya Yelusalemu na kuwegala ko usamizo uko Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Nebukadineza aguhaga wantu wakankalu wa Yuda, mligano wawo ni wantu elufu mfungate hamwenga na mafundi wakankalu na wafuwa vyuma elufu imwenga, wose awo nendile ni wantu wata nguvu naho wakudaha kugomba nkondo.<verse eid="2KI 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Nebukadineza niyo amwika Mataniya mlukolo ywa ise dya Yehoyakini atende seuta hantu hakwe, zina dyakwe niyo adihitula amwitanga Sedekiya.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Sedekiya ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Sedekiya endaga na mihilimo milongo midi na umwenga umo akakonga kulongoza, kalongoza kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mlongo umwenga na umwenga uko Yelusalemu. Nine naketangwa Hamutali mchiche ywa Yelemiya, mwikazi ywa mzi wa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Seuta Sedekiya kadamanya yehiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile saviya adamanye seuta Yehoyakimu. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awawonela maya vitendese awantu wa Yelusalemu na Yuda, niyo awabalaziza hale naye.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="s">Kwebungwa na kubalangwa komzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Sedekiya ni amhituka seuta Nebukadineza, mwe idizuwa dya mlongo mo mwezi wa mlongo, mhilimo wa chenda wo ulongozi wa Sedekiya, Nebukadineza seuta ywa Babeli hamwenga na awagomba nkondo wakwe wabulaga komzi wa Yelusalemu niyo wawebunga, wautandama wakaheza wauzengela ngome. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Mzi uwo ujendeleza kwebungwa kubula mo mhilimo wa mlongo na umwenga wo ulongozi wa seuta Sedekiya. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Mwe idizuwa dya chenda dyo mwezi wa kane niyo gumbo dyatendesa mo mzi, nendile hemwina nkande kwa awekazi wakwe. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Niyo waponkola langa mwe ichiwambaza cho umzi, nechilo seuta na wagomba nkondo wose niyo wasumka kujinkila kolwivi lwendile hagati gati heviwambaza vidi, niyo waita ntendele za Alaba, hatahegu Wababeli nendile wautandama umzi. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Mna awagomba nkondo wa Babeli niyo wambasa seuta wamtaha kwe dikolongo dya Yeliko, wagomba nkondo wakwe wose niyo wamwasa watimkana. <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />Elo Wababeli niyo wamtaha seuta, wamwigala kwa seuta ywawo uko Libila, naye niyo amkantila. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Vikaheza niyo wawakoma wana wa Sedekiya kulongozi kwakwe, yeye wamtula ameso yakwe. Uhelo wakwe niyo wamnyinya minyolo wamwigala Babeli.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyumba ya Chohile yabalangwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JER 52:12-23">Yelemia 52:12-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Mwe idizuwa dya mfungate, mo mwezi wa shano, mo mhilimo wa mlongo na chenda wo useuta wa Nebukadineza seuta ywa Babeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 25:8">Nebuzaladani chilongozi ywa wamizi wa seuta nakengila Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Niyo ayoka Inyumba ya Zumbe ne idizumba dya seuta ne izinyumba zose za Yelusalemu, chila nyumba nkulu kayoka. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Wagomba nkondo wose wa Babeli nendile wehamwenga na mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo ywa wamizi wa seuta niyo wabogozola iviwambaza zizunguluke umzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Nebuzaladani, mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa seuta niyo awasamiza awegala ko usamizo awantu wendile wasigale ko mzi na wadya wose nendile wenule imikono wenye kwa seuta ywa Babeli hamwenga na wantu watuhu wose. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Mna yudya sekulu ywa awagomba nkondo kawasa wantu wasiku wachiwa vitendese mwe isi chani watundulie imizabibu na kulima izinkonde. <verse eid="2KI 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Wantu wa Babeli niyo wazitula vihandehande izinguzo ze shaba nendile zikwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, hamwenga na chegamilo che bilika kulu dititu dya shaba nendile dimwe nyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, shaba waiguha waigala Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Naho wegala nyungu na makulega yakusiza maivu na mikasi ya kukantila utambi na viya vya shaba vijesezwe mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Niyo wegala vyetezo na mabakuli. Mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wamizi wa seuta niyo avigala Babeli viya vyose vya zahabu na vya mayuwe ya chumbu. <verse eid="2KI 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Shaba yose seuta Sulemani azengele ziya izinguzo izimbili na diya idibilika na vyegamo vyakwe kwachausa che inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile havidahike kuhimwa uzami wakwe. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Chila nguzo nendile ina utali wa futi milongo midi na mfungate na halanga hakwe nendile hana ntumba ya shaba ntitu. Utali wa chila ntumba nendile futi nne na nusu. Chila ntumba naizungulusizwa mpambo za makomamanga, yose ya shaba ntitu.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watu wa Yuda wegalwa ko usamizo uko Babeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JER 52:24-27">Yelemia 52:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Vikaheza, mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wamizi wa seuta niyo amtaha Selaya muwoni mkulu na Zefaniya muwoni ywa kaidi na wamizi watatu we Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Nakaguha mkulu yumwenga momzi achimaile wantu wa nkondo, hamwenga na wantu washano mwe wadya wakuchimala kulongozi kwa seuta, iviya kamguha mta kuwandika ywa mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo uyo atunduliye ulukumbusa lwa wagomba nkondo hamwenga na wantu wamanyikise milongo mtandatu abwile komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Nebuzaladani sekulu ywa wamizi kawaguha awantu awo niyo awegala kwa seuta ywa Babeli uko Libila. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Nebukadineza seuta ywa Babeli niyo alagiza awantu awo watoigwe na kuwakoma uko Libila mwe isi ya Hamati. Ivyo wantu wa Yuda niyo wegalwa ko usamizo hale neisi yawo.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gedaliya atenda chilongozi ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Seuta Nebukadineza ywa Babeli niyo amguha Gedalia mwana ywa Ahikamu mwezukulu ywa Safanu, atende seuta ywa wantu wose wa Yuda hewegalwe Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Vikaheza amasekulu wose wa awagomba nkondo hamwenga na awantu wawo weze weve kugamba seuta ywa Babeli kamsagula Gedaliya atende chilongozi, niyo wambasa Gedaliya uko komzi wa Misipa. Wantu awo wendaga ni Ishimaeli mwana ywa Netaniya na Yonahani mwana ywa Kaleya na Selaya mwana ywa Tanihumeti kulawa komzi wa Netofa na Yezaniya kulawa komzi wa Maaka, hamwenga na awantu wawo. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Gedaliya niyo elisa kulongozi kwawo na awantu wawo, agamba, “Msekuwogoha maseku wa Wababeli. Ikalani mweisi naho msankanileni seuta ywa Babeli, mbuli zenyu naziwachumileni.” <verse eid="2KI 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Mna mwezi wa mfungate Ishimaeli mwana ywa Netaniya mwezukulu ywa Elishama endaga ywa lukolo lwa chiseuta niyo eza kwa Gedaliya na wantu mlongo umwenga na kumkoma Gedaliya hamwenga na wantu wa Yuda na Wababeli wendaga naye uko komzi wa Misipa. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Vikaheza, wantu wose wahwele mweisi ya Izulaeli wakulu kwa wadodo hamwenga na masekulu wa wagomba nkondo, wahalawa waita Misili, kwaviya nendile wakawogoha Wababeli.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyakini alekelwa mwechifungo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JER 52:31-34">Yelemia 52:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Mo mhilimo udya atendaga seuta ywa Babeli, ni alagisa wedi kwe seuta Yehoyakini ywa Yuda, kwa kumlekeila kulawa kwechifungo. Idyo dyendaga zuwa dya milongo midi na mfungate mo mhilimo dyo mwezi wa mlongo na mbil, mhilimo wa milongo mitatu na mfungate umo Yehoyakimu aguhigwe kwigalwa ko usamizo. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Kalosana naye vyedi niyo amwinka luhenyo lwa ntunyo kujinka maseuta wose wendaga hamwenga naye uko Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Ivyo, Yehoyakini niyo avika suche ntuhu ukaleka ziya za kwechifungo. Mazuwa yose nkande yakwe nendile akadya kwa seuta. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Naho chila zuwa seuta nendile akamwinka Yehoyada viya akunga mazuwa yose yo wikazi wakwe.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>